<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Hona Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Yahaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yahaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yahaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yahaya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yahaya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Ƙǝrǝsti ni laɓarɗi mbuwa ngwalarha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ka a katǝradghǝn na Laɓar ɗa sǝ, na Laɓarɗi tǝ Faara, Laɓar ɗi Faara ni. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ka a katǝradghǝn nǝghǝn tǝ Faara. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Tǝ Laɓar ɗa ni ǝnana Faara ǝngya heu; mbǝ ˈyasǝ ǝna nanda kula ndǝghǝn wa. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Na Laɓar ɗi fǝr yibrha a ǝngya heu ǝnana nda, yiɓǝdɗi ya ƙǝm kukwaryid fiya ni. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Na kukwaryidɗi djaara hai hu wula, wulɗi ƙǝm mbǝ sǝsǝmnda sǝ a fadghǝn wa. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Na niifa sǝ thlǝnna Faara ɓa, thlǝmnggǝn ni Yahaya. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Tǝ kalmee ni, ɓanǝn ɓa ka a kalmii kukwaryidɗa nǝn, tǝna fiya heu sǝk laɓar kukwaryidɗi fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝ kalmii ɗi keeghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Mbǝ Yahaya tafadghǝn ndǝna kukwaryidɗi wa, amma ɓanǝn ɓa ka a kalmii kukwaryidɗa nǝn. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ka kukwaryirha na a fǝrang kukwaryirha nǝn kowunni, nǝghǝn ɓayi hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Na kukwaryidɗi hu ƙǝshiirha, ko nanǝn ǝnagha nda ƙǝshiirha tǝghǝn, amma sǝngwa ƙǝshiirha ndǝn wa. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ɓa kukwaryidɗi ahu chehweedghǝn ɓa, amma nafiyighǝn thlǝwa ndan fa wa. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Amma kala nafiya thlǝgha kukwaryidɗa fa, fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝghǝn, fǝrang ɗǝ kwamana kanda a tsawa nda wangya Faara. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Tsau nda wundakhnaya mbǝ ka nggǝt na niifa kanda wa, mbǝ tǝ nggǝmnda niifa wa, amma tǝ nggǝmnda Faara. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Laɓarɗi tsauɗǝ niifa, tsauƙǝn ahur nǝm. Naɗǝm mamnggitghǝn, mamnggit wee na katenggǝn a thlǝmad chin, nǝghǝn lǝlǝgɗa tǝ nggayirha tǝ ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />(Kal Yahaya mighǝn, tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ tǝ ndaarha, “Niifɗa ni pǝrang ni kun ya, ndaa ni, ‘Na niifa sǝ ɓayi a samad na kalgha nggi mu, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn sǝ kapa na nda nggǝt nggi.’ ”) <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ka nggayidghǝn mulgha hai, nǝn naarha fǝrang parka ƙǝm ƙǝtsar. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Fǝr Faara ngyakhrha a manki Musa, amma nggayirha tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek ɓaghǝn ɓa a manki Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Mbǝ niifa sǝ ˈwagha na Faara wa, amma yanɗi ndǝghǝn tafadghǝn Faara ni, tǝ ƙǝm nǝghǝn a tsau ɗǝdemnggirha tǝ Chin, ndǝn kyadgha Faara.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlǝk Yahaya Tǝmbaptisǝma laɓara aten Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Kulo kalmiɗi ki Yahaya ya a sayidɗi thlǝnna Yahudaya Firistaya tǝ Lawiya a Urshalima ɓa, ka ɗa nda tsahang mee ha, “Wunni sa?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ngalwa Yahaya wa, amma kyagha pǝpal ɓa ndanggǝn kanda, “Mbǝ nggini Ƙǝrǝsti wa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Tsahang mee nda, “Nanǝn kee, wunni sa? Sani Ilya wa?” Ndanggǝn kanda, “Mbǝ nggini wa.” Nggǝra nda tsahang mee, “Sani annabi ɗi nan a ƙǝlarha fa wa?” Ndanggǝn kanda, “Awo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Tǝrgha ndang ngganda, “Wunni sa? Nggǝrang kan sǝ ka ɗan pǝranggǝn nafini thlǝngga kan ɓa. Mana mbang thlǝkrha a ten wa?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Nggǝrangga Yahaya kanda sǝ tǝ laɓar annabi Ishaya, “Nggini urarha na a aah farha a kaheerha, ‘Pǝpǝnaman kwamangya ɗǝ a Chinǝm.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Tǝrgha Farisayini thlǝnna nda ɓa, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />tsahang mee nda ha, “Kama nda na a ǝna mbaptisǝma a mbǝ sani Ƙǝrǝsti, nduwa Ilya, nduwa Annabidɗi wa?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Nggǝrangga Yahaya kanda sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Nggi tǝ aama ni ǝna mbaptisǝma, amma na niifa sǝ ƙǝt a pathlang nun sǝngwa nun. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ndǝghǝnni na ɓayi a samad na ɗi, nggi tafanna tsǝkki na a kwasanggi sahad pahamnggǝn hai wa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Katǝragha ǝnɗa hai heu ya a Mbetani a pǝm kufad Urdun, na Yahaya a ǝna mbaptisǝma sǝ.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeeso ni Wan kamnda Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />A ɓindayidghǝn nagha Yahaya Yeeso ɓayi thlǝmadghǝn ɓa, ndagha, “Ƙǝlaman wan Kamnda Faara ya, na a tǝrang ɗimiyid ƙǝshiirha ɗǝ! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Niifɗa ni pǝrang ni kun tǝ ndaarha, ‘Na niifa sǝ ɓayi a samad na kalgha nggi mu, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn sǝ kapa na nda nggǝt nggi.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nggi tafanna sǝngwi ndǝn wa, amma niyi a ǝna mbaptisǝma tǝ aama tǝna nafiya Isǝreelaya sǝnggǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Tǝrgha ndagha Yahaya, “Naɗi Sǝsǝna ɓayi hai a talara ƙǝla tǝtiliurha tsauka hai a fadghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Sǝngwi ndǝn wa, amma Faarɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa ka ɓi ǝna mbaptisǝma tǝ aama, ndǝghǝn ndeegha, ‘Niifɗi nana Sǝsǝna tǝrɗǝ tenggǝn hai tsauka sǝ, ndǝghǝn ni na a ǝna mbaptisǝma tǝ Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Naɗi ǝnɗi katǝragha hai tǝ Yeeso, nǝghǝn kee, kalɗi mee tǝ ndaarha, niif ɗiya Wan Faara ni.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fatsahaya Yeeso ˈwanǝn wura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />A ɓindayidghǝn nggǝrgha Yahaya isha a mbǝɗi tǝ fatsahayighǝn sǝri a thlǝmadghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Nanǝn Yeeso a mbǝraɗǝ, ndagha, “Ƙǝlama Wan Kamnda Faara ya!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Sǝkna fatsahayina ndǝn keeghǝn sǝri ˈya ndaanǝn, mbu samad Yeeso nda. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Kyaharna Yeeso hai, nanǝn kanda a mbu samadghǝn, tsahang mee nǝn kanda, “Mana minnun?” Ndangganda, “Rabbi, (ndarha ni Mala) na tǝ tsaurha a yanggi?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Ɓama ɓa ɓun naghǝn.” A figrha ni mbu nanda samadghǝn ta mbǝɗaɗǝ nanǝn sǝ tǝ tsaurha ngwalangga nda paara tǝghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andǝrawus, wan man Siman Mbiturus nǝghǝn tal ahur nafini sǝri sǝkka ˈya ndana Yahaya tǝ ƙǝm mbuwa samad Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Tsu kee tǝrgha Andǝrawus kaɗa wanman nǝn Siman pǝranggǝnǝn tǝ ndaarha, “Walang ɗan Ƙǝrǝstiɗi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ɓagha tǝ Siman thlǝmad Yeeso ɓa, Ƙǝlang na Yeeso ngga ndǝghǝn, “Sani Siman wan Yahaya. Amma nanǝnya na nda a aah sa Kefas,” (ndǝna Mbiturus).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aah Yeeso Filibus tǝ Nataniyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />A ɓindayidghǝn na mid Yeeso sǝ a ɗǝgha Nggalili ɗǝ. Na Filibus nǝn, ndanggǝn, “Mbuwu samadna.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filibus niif tǝ Mbatsaida tal nda Andǝrawus tǝ Mbiturus. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Walang na Filibus Nataniyel ndanggǝn, “Naɗan niifɗi chirethna Musa a tenggǝn ahu ngyakhrha, tǝ ƙǝm chirethna annabiya a tenggǝn thlǝmnggǝn ni Yeeso tǝ Nadzarat, wan Yisufu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Tsakhka Nataniyel mee ndǝghǝn, “Nadzarat! Na ˈya sǝ ngga na kyarha ɓa a Nadzarat wa?” Nggǝrangga Filibus sǝ, “Ɓoɓa ɓa naghǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Nana Yeeso Nataniyel ɓayi thlǝmadghǝn ɓa, ndanggǝn, “Kulo ka wan Isǝreela ya na tǝ ƙǝkafek fa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Tsahangga Nataniyel mee Yeeso, “Ƙǝƙǝn sǝnna nggi?” Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Naɗi sa a kamu ɗǝf shiɓaarha kapa na Filibus aah sa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Tǝrgha ndagha Nataniyel, “Mala, sani Wan Faara; Kutǝr Isǝreela.” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Fǝrna ƙǝkafek ƙǝsǝr ka ndoni naɗi sa a kamu ɗǝf shiɓaarha wa? Na nggǝr na ǝngya kalgha fingya yina mu ya.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Nggǝrghǝn ndaarha, “Niya puro ƙǝkafek, na a naa talara inɗaɗǝ, tǝ fathlǝngya Faara a tǝra sǝ tǝ tǝra aten Wan Niifa hai.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Ƙǝn kakhrha a Kaana na a Nggalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />A far ɓeena yi mahan, ǝna wutsǝfayid kakhrha nda ahu tala na nda aarha Kaana a chehweed Nggalili, tǝ ƙǝm man Yeeso a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Tǝrgha mbu Yeeso nda tǝ fatsahayighǝn ahu wutsǝfayid kahadɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ngwalana aam inabi ɗa hai, ndangga man Yeeso, “Mba nda tǝ aam inabi ɓal wa.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Nuɗiya ma njiɗangga ƙǝm? Sayid na ɓa wa ɓa ˈwan wa.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Amma ndangga man Yeeso nafini na a ndǝk ǝnnarhami, “Kala ˈya thlǝghang nǝn kun ǝnama.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />A mbǝɗi na tsulingya sǝ mikki tǝn nanda tǝ feera. Na Yahudaya naarha ǝna taara tǝ tsulinggini ka a tsaɓang fandan saaɗǝ. Kala tsulina nǝn tǝr ƙǝthlikrha kumnggit sǝri ɗǝgha hu kumnggit mahan ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Ndangga Yeeso nafini na a ndǝk ǝnnarhami, “Lǝgɗaman tsulinggini tǝ aama.” Lǝɗang ngganda kanda ta miighǝn sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Tǝrgha ndanggǝn kanda, “Tsaama ha sǝ ɗang nggǝnun mamnda ter ɗa ɗǝ ya.” Əna nda kee ƙǝla thlǝghang nǝn kanda. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mamnda terɗi taarang nǝn aamɗi kyakhrang nanda ahu aam inabi ɗǝ, sǝnangwa mbǝɗa hai kyanǝn sa ɓa wa, (ko nanǝn nafini na a ndǝk ǝnnadɗami sǝn ndan). Tǝrgha aah wutsam ndǝ ɗanǝn a man patu ɗǝ ndanggǝn, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />“Na fiya ˈwa fǝr aam inabi na mbǝnggǝn, akwasamadɗi saana fiya, a kyanggǝn yanɗa ɓa mbuwa wa mbǝnggǝn. Amma sa ɓǝɓengga yanɗi na mbǝnggǝn ƙǝl nanǝnya!” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yanɗiya ndǝna katǝra ǝnwulteena ǝnana Yeeso, ǝnaghǝn ndǝn a Kaana na hu chehweed Nggalili. Kyadɗǝ mamnggidghǝn a mbǝɗi, tǝ ƙǝm fatsahayighǝn fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />A kwasamadɗi ɗǝgha Kafarnahum ɗǝ heu nda man, tǝ wan manggighǝn, tǝ fatsahayighǝn, mǝna nda ha ngguchit a mbǝɗi.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilɓang Yeeso Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ (Matta 21:12-13; Mar 11:15-17; Luka 19:45-46)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Nduwusna far wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha hai, ɗǝgha Yeeso a Urshalima ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />A pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara, ɗǝgha wal fiya a heng thlaaya ɗǝ, tǝ chauraya, tǝ kataprakkya yi sataka, tǝ fingya tsǝtsau a fǝr mbeɗed wuɗǝɓǝla. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yamngga Yeeso wutǝteerha tǝ sakhrha rǝghanggǝn kanda ɗǝ ma Ƙǝn Faara, heu tǝ chauraya tǝ thlaaya, changgǝlanggǝn mbǝd mbeɗed wuɗǝɓǝl ɗa ɗǝ welgha wuɗǝɓǝlɗi hweeɗe hai. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Tǝrgha ndanggǝn nafini na a heng kataprakkya ɗǝ, “Kyaman ǝnggina hai ma mbǝɗiya, a tsawang ɗun wuri Pǝpa kasu wa.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Tǝrgha fatsahayighǝn ɗal teena nda hai tǝ ˈya ndaana ɗeleewar Faara, “Nggǝmndǝna a wuri wa nǝghǝn a ƙǝsa sǝ a hurna ƙǝla waarha.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Tǝrgha mamngya Yahudayini ndangganda Yeeso, “Ənwulten ma na kyaɗang nda kan tǝnan sǝnda sǝ na tǝ sǝsǝmnda ǝna ǝnɗiya?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Chaman Ƙǝn Faar ɗa hai ya, ahu ɓeena mahan niya nggǝr tǝnang sǝ.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Tsahangga Yahudayini mee, “Tǝnang nggan Ƙǝn Faar ɗa sǝ ˈyahu hurarha kumnggit faɗa kap mikki, ndaana wai na nggǝr tǝnang sǝ hu ɓeena mahan?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Amma ƙǝn Faar ɗi nǝn a thlǝkrha pofadghǝn ni. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />A kwasamadɗi thliinǝn sǝ ahu mǝra, fatsahayighǝn ɗal teena nda hai thlǝkɗǝ ˈya kiya. Fǝr nda ƙǝkafek tǝ laɓar Faara, tǝ laɓarɗi thlǝkna Yeeso.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sǝn Yeeso hur kowunni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Nanǝn a Urshalima ahu wutsǝfayid Tǝɗadɗi, fiya hangga nagha ǝnwuteengya kyad nǝn fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Amma nggǝmngwa Yeeso fa tǝ kanda wa, ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗǝ fiya heu. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Mbǝ ˈya sǝ na nda thlǝghang nda a ten niifa wa, ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗǝ hur niifa.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yeeso tǝ Nikodimus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Na niifa sǝ thlǝmnggǝn ni Nikodimus, tǝ Farisarha ni, mamnda ni ahu Yahudaya. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Ɓagha thlǝmad Yeeso ɓa a fiɗikrha ndanggǝn, “Mala, sǝnɗansǝ sa tǝmalǝmnda ni thlǝnna Faara ɓa. Mbǝ niifa sǝ na mbang ǝna ǝnwulteena ƙǝla yanɗi na a ǝnaarha ya wa a mbǝ nana Faara tǝghǝn ha wa.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Niya puro ƙǝkafek, mbǝ niifa sǝ na kyarha hu kutǝryid Faara ɗǝ wa ƙǝl nggǝr nanda nggǝɗang hai.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Tsahangga Nikodimus mee, “Ƙǝƙǝn na nda nggǝr nggǝɗang nda niifa hai ndǝghǝn suhur ɗǝ? Ƙǝkafek mbǝ nggǝr kyarha ahu shiwad man hai nggǝrghǝn nggǝɗang hai yi sǝri wa!” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ tǝ ndaarha, “Niya puro ƙǝkafek, mbǝ niifa sǝ na kyarha ahu kutǝryid Faara ɗǝ kanda kula nggǝɗang hai hu aama tǝ Sǝsǝna wa. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Thlufarha nǝn nggǝt thlufarha, amma Sǝsǝna, nǝn nggǝt Sǝsǝna. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />A wulo teena ka ndoni, ‘A nggǝrgha nda nggǝɗo hai wa.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Na ɓereurha piirha a mbǝɗa ɗǝ na midghǝn. Ƙǝla na sǝk pidghǝn ɗǝ, amma mba mbang pǝr mbǝɗi ɓa nǝn sa ɓa tǝ mbǝɗi nǝn a ɗǝrha saɗǝ wa. Nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm mba mbang pǝr kwamanɗi na nda nggǝɗang niifa hai hu Sǝsǝna wa.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Tsahangga Nikodimus mee, “Na ǝnɗi ǝnaarha hai ƙǝƙǝn ya?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Sa tǝmalǝmnda Isǝrelaya ni, amma sǝnangwa ǝnggina hai ya wa? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Niya puro ƙǝkafek, nan a thlǝk ˈya sǝn nan, nan sakh ˈya ƙǝm na nan, amma pa ya karɗun thlǝ ǝnɗa fa pǝrang nan kun. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />A puro ɗi ǝngya na ahu ƙǝshiirha, amma fǝr wa ƙǝkafek wa. Ƙǝƙǝn na fǝrƙǝkafek a puro ɗi laɓar ǝngya na talara? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Mbǝ niifa sǝ ˈwagha ɗǝrha talara ɗǝ wa, amma ƙǝl niifɗi ɓagha hai a talara, ndǝna Wan Niifa. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Ƙǝla ˈwana Musa tǝrang nda ɗǝɓǝl hulthne sǝ a kaheerha, na nda a tǝrang nda Wan niifa sǝ kee ƙǝm. <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Nanǝn kee, kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a Wan Niifɗi nǝn a wal yibrha mbuwa wa ngwalarha. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ƙǝsǝr Faara nggǝmɗǝ ƙǝshiirha kaan fǝr nǝn Wanggǝn katenggǝn, kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a ndǝghǝn mbǝ tam mǝra wa, amma nǝn a wal yibrha mbuwa ngwalarha. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Thlǝngga Faara Wanggǝn hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa mbǝ a ngwang kumarha nǝn wa, amma a walgha ƙǝshiirha hǝrǝkrha a fadghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a Wan Faara mba nda ngwang kumarha sǝ wa, amma kala niifa fǝrwa wa ƙǝkafek ˈwa ɗǝ teena ngwang ɗǝ kumarha sǝ, ƙǝsǝr fǝr wa ƙǝkafek a Wan Faara katenggǝn wa. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Na Faara a ngwan kumarha fiya sǝ ƙǝsǝr kukwaryirha kyaɗǝ hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa, amma fiya nggǝmnda wula kaan ma kukwaryirha, ƙǝsǝr ǝn ǝnad ndan yi mbǝlfeerha ni. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kala niifa na a ǝna tar mbǝlfeerha karnǝn kukwaryidɗi, mbǝ ɓaarha ahu kukwaryidɗa ɓa wa ka hǝreenga naɗǝ tar mbǝlfedghǝn kyaarha pǝpal ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Amma kala niifa na tǝ ƙǝkafek fa, ɓa nǝn ahu kukwaryidɗa ɓa, tǝna fiya naghǝn a pǝpal tǝ ndaarha ˈya nǝn a ǝnaarha nǝghǝn a ǝna ˈya na mid Faara.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fǝrang Yahaya Tǝbaptisǝma mamnggirha Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />A kwasamad palthɗiya, thliigha Yeeso tǝ fatsahayighǝn ɗǝnda chehweed Yahudiya ɗǝ tsǝnda tsǝɓaku a mbǝɗi nagha a ǝnang mbaptisǝma fiya. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yahaya ƙǝm a ǝna mbaptisǝma a aam Ainon tsau tǝ Salim fa ƙǝsǝr na aama sǝ kaan a mbǝɗi, na fiya naarha ɓarha ɓa ka ǝnang mbaptisǝma nda kanda. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />(Katǝragha ǝnɗa hai ya kapa na nda mughang nda Yahaya ahu porsǝna ɗǝ.) <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Thliigha ngaala sǝ a pathlang fatsahaya Yahaya tǝ niif Yahudiya a ten chilɓi farha. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Nanǝn kee ɓagha fatsahaya Yahaya thlǝmadghǝn ɓa ndangganda, “Mala, ɗalna niifɗi teena ˈwana tsaurha tǝghǝn a pǝm kufad Urdun, thlǝkna pathla a tenggǝn, nǝghǝn a ǝna mbaptisǝma fiya hangga a ɗǝrha thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Nggǝrangga Yahaya kanda sǝ, “Mbǝ niifa sǝ na wal ˈya wa ƙǝl fǝrang na Faara ndǝn hai na a talara. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Kun tafad nun sǝkɗun ǝnɗi thlǝghang ni kun a pǝpal, ‘Mbǝ nggini Ƙǝrǝsti wa, ˈwa ni mbee ɓa ka a kalang mee ni fiya kapa nǝn ɓarha ɓa.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />A far wutsǝfayid kakhrha, wuronga yi wutsamnda ni. Pashirha ɗǝgha hu kahad wutsamnda ɗǝ, nǝn ƙǝlaghǝn ha, kang thlǝmaarha nǝn fa, nǝn tǝk mbǝnda fa a sǝkɗǝ urad wutsamnda. Wutsǝfayidɗi a weeriya yina ni, nanǝnya lǝghǝdɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Tǝta ni nagha aten chikrha kaan, nggi ƙǝm ne a tsǝrha ngguchit.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yanɗi ɓagha hai a talara kalɗǝ kowunni mu, yanɗi kyagha ɓa ahu ƙǝshiirha ƙǝm yi ƙǝshiirha ni, tǝ ƙǝm nǝn thlǝk ǝngya na hu ƙǝshiirha kee. Amma yanɗi ɓagha hai a talara kalɗǝ kowunni. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Nǝn naarha thlǝk ˈya nanǝn tǝ sǝknǝn ƙǝm, amma mbǝ niifa sǝ thlǝgha laɓarghǝn fa wa. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Kala niifa thlǝgha laɓarghǝn fa, sǝnɗasǝ na Faara tǝ ƙǝkafek fa. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ƙǝsǝr yanɗi thlǝnna Faara ɓa laɓar Faara ndǝn nǝn a thlǝkrha, ƙǝsǝr fǝrang Faara Sǝsǝna mbuwa ngwalarha. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Na Chinɗi nggǝm Wanggǝn tǝ ƙǝm fǝrang ɗǝ ǝngya heu ahu haarghǝn hai. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a Wanɗi nǝn wal yibrha mbuwa wa ngwalaarha, amma kala niifa fǝrwa wa ƙǝkafek a Wanɗi mbǝ tam wal yibrha wa, ƙǝl sǝbrha hur Faara ndǝna naarha a tenggǝn.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yeeso tǝ nuneefa na a Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Nanǝnya sǝn Yeeso sǝ Farisaya sǝk nda laɓara atenggǝn nǝghǝn a ǝna mbaptisma a wal fatsahaya ma Yahaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(ko nanǝn, mbǝ Yeeso ni na a ǝna mbaptisǝma wa, amma fatsahayighǝn ni.) <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Walang na Yeeso ˈya na Farisaya a thlǝkrha atenggǝn, thliigha mal Yahudiya nǝn wudgha a Nggalili ɗǝ.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Tsawang ɗa fa tǝta a kyagha tǝ Samariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ɓagha ahu tala ɓa na nda aarha Sikar na a chehweed Samariya, tsau tǝ pǝpal ɗa fa fǝrang na Yakubu wanggǝn Yisufu ƙǝtǝm. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />A hu talɗi na Kwat aam Yakubu sǝ, tǝkna widɗi Yeeso tsauka hai a thlǝmad kwat aamɗi. Yanfaara a sǝrǝkrha.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ɓagha nu tǝ Samariyarha ka tsǝ aama ɓa, ndangga Yeeso, “Ənee aama ha see.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Ahu sayidɗi Yeeso nǝghǝn katenggǝn ƙǝsǝr fatsahayighǝn kyanda hur tala hai ka ɗanda hii ǝnnarhami.)<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Ƙǝsgha ǝnwulteena nuɗi ndanggǝn, “Sa tǝ Yahudarha ni, nggi nu tǝ Samariyarha. Kama nda na tsahe aam saarha?” (Ƙǝsǝr Yahudaya na nda tsan Samariyaya.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “A ndam kwang sǝnna fǝrra Faara a sa, tǝ ƙǝm tǝ wunni tsahowa aam saarha, kam ndangna a ǝnoghǝn ha, kam nǝn a fǝro aam fǝr yibrha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Ndangga nuɗi, “Paɓa, mbǝ ǝn tsǝ aama sǝ a harwa wa kwat aamɗi ƙǝm ya nǝghǝn kuɗimnggǝn. Na wal aam fǝr yiɓǝdɗi a yanggi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Kalna chinan Yakubu rangga kwat aamɗi kansǝ ya, saagha, ndǝghǝn tǝ wanggighǝn, heu tǝ chiɓǝd maɓiyighǝn wa?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Kala niifa saagha amɗiya na hushimnda nggǝr ƙǝsghǝn, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />amma yi saagha aamɗi niya fǝrang nda mbǝ hushimnda nggǝr ƙǝsghǝn wa. Aamɗi niya fǝrang nda nǝn a tsawang fa mbǝd ngǝtta aama na fǝrang yibrha pa kwanɗǝ.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ndangga nuɗi Yeeso, “Paɓa, fǝree tur aamɗi ya lee amawana hushimnda nggǝr ƙǝs nggi tǝni malang ɓarha ka tsǝ aama mbǝɗa ɓa ya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Ɗuwa ɗǝ, ɗa aah chimad wa ɓon ɓa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Nggǝrangga nuɗa sǝ, “Mbǝ chimad na sǝ wa.” Ndangga Yeeso, “Thlǝkna ƙǝkafek ndana mbǝ chimadwa sǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Pǝrna ƙǝkafek, chimaya tuf ˈwagha kahorha, niifɗi nana tǝghǝn nanǝnya mbǝ chimadwa ni wa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ndagha nuɗi, “Paɓa, mbǝ ngaala sǝ wa Annabi ni sa. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Nanǝn kee pǝreeƙǝn, chichiyi nan tǝrang nda shilee Faara teena a wumndǝɗi ya, amma kun Yahudaya nduwun mbǝrha kamngga a tǝrang shilee nǝm Faara teena a Urshalima ni.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Sa nuɗiya, furu ƙǝkafek tǝ palthɗi niya thlǝworha ya, na sayi ɓayi mbuwa na fiya tǝrang shilee Pǝpa in a wumndǝɗi ya nduwa a Urshalima. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Kun Samariyaya nuwun a tǝrang shilee ˈya teena sǝngwa wa nun, kan nan tǝrang shilee ˈya teena sǝn nan, ƙǝsǝr na hǝrǝkrha a kyarha ɓa a fad Yahudaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Amma na sayi ɓayi, ˈwaɗǝ teena ɓaɗa ɓa, fiya na tǝrang shilee Pǝpa teena hu ƙǝkafek na nda a tǝrang shilee teena hu Sǝsǝna tǝ ƙǝkafek, ƙǝsǝr tur nafina ni na Pǝpa a kaɗaarha ya. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Faara sǝsǝna ni, nafiya na a tǝrang shilee teena ƙǝl a ǝnaghǝnda hu sǝsǝna tǝ ƙǝkafek.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ndangga nuɗi, “Sǝnɗisǝ Ƙǝrǝsti na nda aarha Ƙǝrǝsti nǝghǝn ɓayi. A ɓaɗa ɓa, ɓanǝn pǝrang ǝngya kan heu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Tǝrgha ndangga Yeeso, “Nggini Ndǝghǝn.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />A sayidɗi na nanda a ngwalang pathla kee, tǝrgha ɓagha fatsahayighǝn ɓa ƙǝsgha ǝnwulteena kanda na nandan a ndikrha tǝ nuneefa. Amma mbǝ niifa sǝ tsakhka mee, “Mana midwa wa?” Nduwa “Kama na a ndikrha tǝ nuɗiya wa?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Tǝrgha malangga nuɗi ɓǝd tsǝ aamnggǝn a mii kwat aamɗi ɗǝgha hur tala ɗǝ ndanggǝn fiya, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Ɓamaɓa ɓun na niifa pǝreegha ǝngya heu ˈwani ǝnaarha! Tǝ ndǝghǝn ɗani na Ƙǝrǝsti?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Nanǝn kee, kyagha fiya ɓa ahur talɗi ɓa nda thlǝmad Yeeso ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Na inggini a katǝrarha hai ya, hwan nggǝna fatsahayighǝn, “Mala, ǝno ˈya mii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Amma ndanggǝn kanda, “Na ǝnnarhami sǝ a haar na sǝngwa nun.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Tǝrgha ndangga fatsahayighǝn ndan, “Na niifa sǝ ɓangga ǝnnarhami ɓa wa?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Ndagha Yeeso, “Ən nanna mii, a ǝna ǝnɗa ni ndeena niifɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa tǝ ƙǝm ngwalanggi targhǝn. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mbǝ nduwun, ‘Takh ndǝree faɗa a katǝrang ngganda haathla hai wa’? Niya ndang nda kun, inaman yid nun ɗǝ ƙǝlanggun heeya ɗǝ ngga! Tsǝk nda haathla. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Ko nanǝnya tǝ haathla nǝn a wal ƙǝnaghǝn, nanǝnya ma hathlang ɗǝ ǝnnarhami hai yi yibrha mbuwa ngwalaarha, tǝna tǝ hǝfrha tǝ tǝhaathla ǝna wutsǝfayirha kyab. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Karapu ɗi ya ƙǝkafek ni, ‘Niifa a hǝfrha, niifa pak a hathla.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Thlǝnni kun ka halth heerha ɗǝ hǝfwa wa nun. Nafiya pak ǝnagha tarɗi, amma kun ƙǝm tǝk ɗun mbǝnda tarɗa fa ǝna nanda.” <verse eid="JHN 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Samariyaya hangga kyagha ɓa hu talɗi fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ Yeeso ƙǝsǝr ka palthɗi kii nuɗi ndanǝn, “Pǝree ɗǝ ǝngya ˈwani ǝnaarha heu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ɓana Samariya yini thlǝmadghǝn ɓa, hwanggǝnda a tsauka tǝ kanda, ǝna ɓeena nǝn sǝri. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Ƙǝsǝr ka laɓarghǝn sǝkna fiya, nggǝrgha fingya hangga fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Ndangga Samariya yini nuɗi, “Fǝr nan ƙǝkafek mbǝ ka palthwa kee wa, amma ƙǝsǝr kan ma sǝk ɗan ndǝn tafan nan, ƙǝkafek sǝnɗansǝ niifɗiya ndǝghǝn ni tǝhǝrghang nda ƙǝshiirha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƙǝnang Yeeso wan mamnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />A kwasamadɗi ǝna nǝn ɓeena sǝri ɗǝgha mbeeɗǝ tǝ wiirha a Nggalili ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yeeso tafadghǝn ˈwaɗǝ ndaarha mbǝ annabi wal mamnggirha ahu chehweedghǝn wa. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ko nanǝn kee, sǝl nǝn Nggalili ɗǝ, thlǝgha Nggalila yini ndǝn fa, ƙǝsǝr nanda ǝngya heu ǝnanǝn a Urshalima hu wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha ɗǝna nda saɗǝ.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Nggǝrghǝn ɗǝrha tal Kaana ɗǝ na a chehweed Nggalili, a mbǝɗi kyakhrang nǝn aama tsauka aam inabi. A mbǝɗi na mamnda sǝ na fad wanggǝn ɓee a Kafarnahum. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Sǝkna niifɗi mal Yeeso Yahudiya sǝl ɗǝ Nggalili ɓa, ɗǝgha thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ hwanggǝnǝn ɓagha ƙǝnang wanggǝn na tsau tǝ mii mǝrra fa a Kafarnahum.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Kun nafiya a nawun ǝnwuteengya tǝ ǝnsakhkya wa, mbun tam fǝrƙǝkafek wa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ndagha mamndǝɗi, “Paɓa, ta wim kapa na waana mǝra.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Na mbang wiirha. Na wan wa a ƙǝnda.” Niifɗi fǝrƙǝkafek nǝn tǝ palth Yeeso wiigha wureeɗǝ.<verse eid="JHN 4:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ndǝghǝn ɓalɗǝ hu kwamana, ɓa mafayighǝn walghǝn ndangganda, “Wan wa ƙǝnɗǝ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Tsahang mee nun kanda sayidɗi ƙǝn nǝn. Ndangganda, “Kalgha wanhadɗa ndǝn hai a ɓǝrarha yanfaara a sǝrǝkrha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Tǝrgha chin wanɗi ƙǝlagha hai na sayidɗi mǝmǝl ndangna Yeeso, “Na wan wa a ƙǝnda.” Tǝrgha ndǝghǝn heu tǝ fa wurayighǝn fǝrƙǝkafek nda. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ndǝn na ǝnwulteena yi sǝri kyadna Yeeso mal nǝn Yahudiya ɗǝnǝn Nggalili ɗǝ.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Ƙǝnang Yeeso sǝfǝnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />A kwasamadghǝn, ɗǝgha Yeeso Urshalima ɗǝ ƙǝsǝr ka far wutsǝfayid ǝntin Yahudaya. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />A Urshalima tsau tǝ kwatkirǝm chaukhraya fa na wutambarra aama sǝ na Ibraniyaya aarha Mbetasda kang nanda tǝ mǝthlǝmngya tuf. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />A ka mǝthlǝm nggini ya fingya mbuwa ƙǝkanglang, kwamaya, tǝ sǝfǝngya tǝ fingya mǝrna fandan hai ndǝna nda hunaarha sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />(Na nafini naarha ƙǝla far ɗa fa na nda a rǝɓang nda aamɗi. Ƙǝsǝr sayi sayi na tǝthlǝnda Faara ɓarha ɓa rǝbanggǝn aamɗi. Kala niifa ˈwagha ahu aamɗa hai nǝn wal ƙǝnda ahu kala tur yanggi wanharha.) <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />A mbǝɗi na niifa sǝ na tǝ wanhaarha fa hurarha kumnggit mahan kap wuvaɗa. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Nana Yeeso ndǝn kalth sǝnang ɗa hai mǝnɗaha tǝ wanhadɗi tsahang mee nǝn, “Na midwa sǝ a ƙǝna na wa?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Ndangga hadɗi, “Paɓa, mbǝ niifa sǝ na a ɗeesǝ kee hu aamɗa hai a sayidɗi tsǝnǝn ˈya fa wa. A naɗi a kyarha sa hai, ˈwagha niifa ma nggi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Tǝrgha ndangga Yeeso, “Thliusǝ, tǝrang ɗǝnggǝl wa wiina!” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Tsu a mbǝɗi kee ƙǝngga niifɗi; tǝranggǝn ɗǝnggǝlghǝn wiigha. Katǝragha ǝnɗa hai ya a far yiɓǝd Yahudaya. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Ndangga Yahudayini niifɗi ƙǝngga, “Far yibrha ni a weeriya, ˈYaɗa ngyahad nǝm taara a far yibrha tǝ ƙǝm mǝmǝlwa a tǝrangga ɗǝnggǝl hunad wa sǝ wa!” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Amma nggǝrangga niifɗi kanda sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Niifɗi ƙǝneegha ndǝn ndeegha, a tǝranggi ɗǝnggǝl na wii.” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Tsahang mee nda, “Wunni niifɗi ndowa a tǝrangga ɗǝnggǝlwa wiina?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Niifɗi ƙǝnang nanda sǝngwa niifɗi ƙǝnangga wa, ƙǝsǝr Yeeso timɗǝ ahur fiyaɗǝ na a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />A kwasamadghǝn ɗa Yeeso naghǝn ahu Ƙǝn Faara ndanggǝn, “Ƙǝnna nanǝnya, a nggǝrna ǝna ɗimiyirha wa a mbǝ kee wa na ˈya a wal sa kalgha yanɗa mu ya.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Wiigha niifɗi kaɗa Yahudayina nǝn ndanggǝn kanda Yeeso ni ƙǝnangga.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Nanǝn kee, ƙǝsǝr ka ǝnggini na Yeeso a ǝnaarha a far Yibrha, katǝrangga Yahudayini mbǝlfeeghǝn hai. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Ƙǝtsar na Pǝpa narha ǝna taara, nggima niyi kee.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Nanǝn kee, ƙǝsǝr ka tur palth yini thlǝk nǝn, tǝrgha Yahudayini ɗǝnda mbeeɗǝ tǝ kaɗa kwamana na a ɓǝlangganda. Mbǝ ka tǝɗang nǝn ngyakhrha far yiɓǝd Yahudaya teena wa, amma ka nda nǝn chin ni Faara, tǝ ƙǝm tsawanggǝn fadghǝn mǝmǝl tǝ Faara.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fǝrang Faara sǝsǝmnda Wanggǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Tǝrgha pǝrang nggǝna Yeeso kanda ndǝghǝn, “Ƙǝkafek niya ndang nda kun, mbǝ ˈyasǝ na wanɗi ǝnaarha tǝ altenggǝn wa; nǝn ǝna ˈya nanǝn na Chin ǝnaarha, ƙǝsǝr kala ˈya na Chinɗi ǝnaarha wanɗi ƙǝm nǝn ǝnaarha kee. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Ƙǝsǝr Chinɗi nǝghǝn a nggǝm Wanɗi, nǝn kyaɗang ǝngya heu ǝnanǝn. Na chinɗi ƙǝm nggǝr kyaɗang ǝngya na mǝmanggǝn kalgha yanɗiya, tǝnun na ǝnwulteena. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ƙǝsǝr ƙǝla na Chinɗi thleng nda mǝrya sǝ fǝrang yibrha nǝn kanda, na wanɗi ƙǝm fǝr yibrha a niifa nggǝmna hurghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ƙǝmɗaarha, mbǝ Chinɗi ngwang kumarha niifa wa, amma fǝrang ɗǝ sǝsǝmnda ngwa kumarha Wanggǝn. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Tǝna kowunni fǝrang mamnggirha wanɗi, ƙǝla na nda fǝrang mamnggirha Chinɗi. Amma kala niifa kargha fǝrang mamnggirha wanɗa fa, kar nǝn fǝrang mamnggirha chinɗi thlǝngga ndǝn ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kala niifa sǝkka palth na fǝrƙǝkafek nǝn a Faara thlǝngga nggi ɓa nǝn wal yibrha mbuwa ngwalaarha. Mbǝ ngwa kumarha sǝ a tendan wa, ƙǝsǝr ˈwanda teena tǝɗang nda mǝrra in ahu yibrha ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, na farghǝn ɓaghai, nanǝnya ma ˈwaɗǝ teena ɓaɗa ɓa. Na mǝrra a sǝk urad Wan Faara. Fingya sǝkka ndǝn na nda a wal yibrha. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ƙǝla nana Chinɗi tafadghǝn ndǝghǝnni tǝ kwaman yibrha ha, nanǝn kee ƙǝm fǝrang ɗǝ sǝsǝmnda Wanggǝn nagha tǝ kwaman yibrha ha. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Tǝ ƙǝm fǝrang ɗǝ sǝsǝmnda na a ngwa kumarha nǝn ƙǝsǝr ndǝghǝnni Wan Niifa.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />“A ƙǝs ǝnwulteena kun a ten ǝnɗiya wa, ƙǝsǝr na sayi ɓaghai mǝrya na ahu ten kwaya na nda a sǝk urad Wan Niifa. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Kya nda sǝ, fingya ǝnagha ngga na nda a thliirha sǝ ahu yibrha ɗǝ mbuwa ngwalarha, fa mbǝlfeeya ƙǝm na nda a thliirha sǝ ngwang kumarha nda kanda sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Mbi mbang ǝna ˈya katenna wa; niya ngwa kumarha ƙǝla thlǝye Faara. Ngwa kumanna yi ƙǝkafek ni, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn a ten nggǝmnda hur Faara thlǝngga nggi ɓa, amma mbǝ yi altenna ni wa.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fingya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek aten Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“A naɗi a fer shedawa a tenna, ˈya niya thlǝkrha mbǝ tsaurha yi ƙǝkafek wa. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Amma ana niifa sǝ ƙǝm fǝrgha shedawa a tenna, sǝnɗisǝ palth ɗi nǝn a thlǝkrha a tenna ƙǝkafek ni.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />“Thlǝn ɗun fiya a thlǝmad Yahaya ɗǝ, ndǝghǝnggi ƙǝm pǝrangɗǝ ƙǝkafek kun. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ko nanǝn kee mbǝrsa wii tǝ shedawa niifa a tenna wa, thlǝkni ndǝn kee tǝnun wal hǝrǝkrha. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yahaya nǝghǝn ƙǝla patilla na a ƙǝsa fǝr kukwaryirha nǝn, tǝ ƙǝm tǝk ɗun mbǝnda laɓarghǝn fa ahu sayi ngguchit.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />“Amma shedawa a tenna kalɗǝ yi Yahaya. Ƙǝsǝr tarɗi fǝrena Pǝpa a ngwalanggi, ndǝghǝnni nani a ǝnaarha ya, ndǝn kyadgha ndaarha Pǝpa ndǝn thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Tǝ ƙǝm Pǝpa thlǝngga nggi ɓa, ndǝghǝnni tafadghǝn na a fǝr shedawa atenna. ˈWawun sǝk uradghǝn wa nduwa nawunun tǝ yirha wa, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />tǝ ƙǝm laɓarghǝn tsaukwa ahur nun wa, ƙǝsǝr fǝr wun ƙǝkafek a niifɗi thlǝn nǝn ɓa wa. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Nun naarha karata Ɗeleewar Faara, ƙǝsǝr nuwun a numad ndaarha ahurghǝn nǝn a fǝrang yibrha kun mbuwa ngwarha. Ɗeleewar yina ni na a fǝr shedawa a tenna a kun. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ko nanǝn kee, karɗun fa a ɓon thlǝmanna ɓa tǝnun wal yibrha.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Mbi thlǝ faala a fad nafiya wa, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗi kun. Sǝnɗi sǝ mbǝ nggǝmnda Faara sǝ ahur nun wa. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ɓayi ɓa ahu thlǝm Pǝpa, kar ngya nun fa; amma a ɓad niifa ɓa pak ahu thlǝm altenggǝn, nun a thlǝghǝn fa. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ƙǝƙǝn nun fǝrƙǝkafek a naɗun a thlǝ faala a ten kun ndan, amma mbuwun a kaɗa thlǝ faala na a kyaarha ɓa a thlǝmad Faara katenggǝn wa?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />“A numaɗun niya huhwa kun a mbed Pǝpa wa. Niifa na a huhwa kun ndǝna Musa, kyanun kya shang teena fa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Andam fǝrɗun ƙǝkafek a Musa, kam fǝrɗun ƙǝkafek a nggi, ƙǝsǝr chireelth ɗǝ ˈya a tenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Amma fǝr wun ƙǝkafek aten ˈya chireelth nǝn wa, ƙǝƙǝn nun fǝrƙǝkafek a ten ˈya thlǝkni?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Hǝɓang Yeeso fiya haru kumnggit tuf</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />A kwasamadghǝn, tǝɗangga Yeeso wuri aam Nggalili teena na nda aarha wuri aam Tibariyas. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Fiya hangga mbuwa samadghǝn ƙǝsǝr nanda ǝnwulteengya ƙǝnang nǝn fingya mbuwa wa ƙǝkanglang. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Tǝrgha Yeeso wumnda sǝ tsauka hai tǝ fatsahayighǝn a thlǝmadghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Wutsǝfayid Yahudaya yi tǝɗaarha nduwusɗa ɓa.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Ƙǝlana Yeeso ɗǝ na fiya nǝn hangga a ɓarha thlǝmadghǝn ɓa, tsahang mee nǝn Filibus, “A yanggi nǝm hii mburodi ɓa nǝm fǝrang nda nafiniya kii nda?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Tsahangna Yeeso mee Filibus kee ka a ƙǝƙǝranggǝn, ƙǝsǝr ˈwaɗǝ teena sǝnɗǝ ˈya nǝn a ǝnaarha. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Nggǝrangga Filibus sǝ, “Ai ko wuɗǝɓǝl rapathlaarha yi ɓeena haru sǝri mbǝ heng mburodi ɓa na a walgha kowunni ngguchit ǝnagha mii wa!” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Tǝrgha tal ahur fatsahayighǝn na thlǝmnggǝn Andrawus, wanman Siman Mbiturus ndǝghǝn, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Kulo wundakhnee ya tǝ mburodi tuf ǝnana nda tǝ humbad wan hwaliirha na nda aarha mbale, tǝ tǝna nggun-ngguchit sǝri, amma ma nǝn ǝnang nda fiya hangga kiya?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Ndangga Yeeso fatsahayighǝn, “Ndaman fiya tsawa nda hai.” Na hwaliiya sǝ a mbǝɗi tsawa nda sa hai, hǝshya ǝnanda haru kumnggit tuf. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Tǝrgha harangga Yeeso mburodi yina sǝ usa Faara nǝn, ndǝghang nggǝnda fiya ɗǝ tsauka hai. Ənagha kee ƙǝm tǝ tǝnɗi. Kowunni ǝnagha mii ƙǝla na midghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />A kwasamadɗi ǝnana fiya mii nggal nda, ndangga Yeeso fatsahayighǝn, “Wuma man katǝbghǝn ɓa a sǝb ˈya ɗǝ wa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Nanǝn kee wumangga fatsahayighǝn katǝbɗa ɓa lǝɗanggǝn kutasya kumkap sǝri, wato kukutethla mburodi ɗi tuf ǝnana nda tǝ humbarha kiina fiya. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />A kwasamadɗi nana fiya ǝnwulten ɗi ǝnana Yeeso, katǝrang ngganda ndaarha hai, “Ƙǝkafek Annabi ɗani ya na a ɓaarha hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Ƙǝlana Yeeso hai na mindan sǝ tǝta a faɗang ngganda kutǝra, ngǝrgha hai nggǝrghǝn tǝra wumnda sǝ katenggǝn.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wii Yeeso a ten aama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Tsǝna figrha hai, ɗǝgha fatsahayighǝn a mii wuri aamɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Kya nda ahu kombuwol hai katǝrang ngganda tǝɗang aamɗi teena ka a ɗǝnda Kafarnahum ɗǝ. Wula a tsǝrha hai Yeeso kula wutta ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Tǝrgha thliigha ɓereurha ɓa nagha tsang ˈya aamɗa fa. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Hur nanda kombuwol ɗaɗǝ mel mahan nduwa faɗa, ƙǝla nda hai Yeeso a wiirha a ten aama, ɓayi thlǝmad kombuwol ɗa ɓa, tǝrma nda. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Amma ndanggǝn kanda, “Nggini; a tǝrǝmɗun wa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Tǝrgha Fatsahayini na mindan sǝ a kyangganda ahu kombuwol ɗa hai, amma ƙǝla nda hai tsu kee sǝl nda a mbǝɗaɗǝ na mindan ɗǝrha saaɗǝ.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaɗa fiya Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai fingya fiya wumngga hai a pǝm wuri aamɗi ƙǝla nda hai kwambuwol tal ɓagha mbǝɗa ɓa kee, Yeeso ƙǝm kyawa ahur kombuwol ɗa hai tǝ fatsahayighǝn wa, amma wiigha fatsahayighǝn katen ndan. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Kombuwolya hangga ɓagha ɓa a Timbariyas, isha nda hai tsau tǝ mbǝɗi kiina fiya mburodi ɗa sǝ a kwasamadɗi usana Chinǝm Faara. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ƙǝlana fiya ɗǝ wumngga hai nawa nda Yeeso wa, nduwa fatsahayighǝn a mbǝɗi wa, kya nda hu kombuwolyina hai, ɗǝnda Kafarnahum ɗǝ ka a kaɗa Yeeso nda.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeeso ni mburodi yi fǝr yibrha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ɗǝna fiya walghǝn a pǝm wuri aamɗi, tsahang mee nda, “Mala, a kwan ɓana mbǝɗa ɓa ya?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, nuwun a kaɗa nggi, mbǝ ka sǝnang nun ǝnwulteengya hai wa, amma ka kii nun mburodi ɗi nggal ɗun. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />A ǝnaɗun taara ka ǝnnarhami na a sǝbrha ɗǝ wa, amma ǝnama taara yi ǝnnarhami na fǝr yibrha mbuwa ngwalaarha, na Wan Niifa a fǝrang kun. Ƙǝsǝr Faara, na Chinɗi ndǝn fǝrangga kwaman fǝr yibrha.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Tǝrgha tsahang mee nda, “Ma nan ǝnaarha na a tǝranggan hur Faara sǝ?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “ˈYa tǝtal ni kee na mid Faara a ǝnon, fǝrama ƙǝkafek a niifɗi thlǝn nǝn ɓa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ndangganda, “Kyaɗang ǝnwulteena kan ana midwa sǝ fǝro ƙǝkafek nan. Mana a ǝnaarha? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Chichiyi nan kin nda manna a kaheerha, ƙǝla nanǝn chichirethlee hai: ‘Fǝrang ɗǝ mburodi kanda a talara hai a ǝna nda mii.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, mbǝ Musa ni fǝrangga mburodi ɗi kun na a talara hai wa, amma na Pǝpa naarha fǝrang ka mburodi kun hai a talara. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Ka mburodi yi Faara ndǝghǝn ni ɓagha hai a talara, na fǝr yibrha a ƙǝshiirha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Ndangganda, “Paɓa, no naarha fǝrang tur mburodi ɗi kan ya ƙǝtsar!”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Tǝrgha Yeeso nggǝranggǝn kanda sǝ, “Nggini mburodi yi fǝr yibrha. Kala niifa ɓagha thlǝmanna ɓa mbǝ miirha nggǝr ƙǝsghǝn wa, kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ nggi ɓalwa hushimnda ƙǝsghǝn wa. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Amma ƙǝla pǝrang ni kun, naɗun nggi, ta weeri ɗaɓa ya ɓalwun kula fǝrƙǝkafek. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Kala nafiya fǝree na Pǝpa na nda ɓaarha thlǝmanna ɓa, nggi ƙǝm mbi tam kar kanda wa. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Ƙǝsǝr ɓayi hai a talara mbǝ ka ǝna tar altenna ni wa, amma ka ǝna tar ɗa ni na mid Faara thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ənɗani na mid niifɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa ya, a sahad tal ahur nafini fǝree nǝn ɓa wa, amma a thlenggi kanda sǝ tǝ yibrha a far ngwala ƙǝshiirha. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ƙǝsǝr ˈya na mid Pǝpa ndǝna kala niifa ƙǝlangga Wanɗa ɗǝ fǝrƙǝkafek nǝn tǝghǝn, nǝn a wal yibrha mbuwa ngwalaarha, tǝ ƙǝm ni a thleng sǝ a far ngwala ƙǝshiirha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Tǝrgha Yahudayini katǝrangganda huhurumnda hai a tenggǝn ƙǝsǝr ndanǝn, “Nggini mburodi yi fǝr yibrha ɓagha hai a talara.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Ndaa nda “Kamshiɗi ya mbǝ Yeeso ɗani na wan Yisufu, sǝn nǝm nda man tǝ chin ya wa? Ƙǝƙǝn nǝn ndaarha, ‘Ɓaghǝn hai a talara’?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Malaman huhurumnda a pathlang nun. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Mbǝ niifa sǝ na ɓaarha thlǝmanna ɓa wa ƙǝl Pǝpa thlǝngga nggi puwangga thlǝmanna ɓa, nggi ƙǝm niya thleng sǝ a far ngwala ƙǝshiirha. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Nǝghǝn chichirethlee hai ahu ɗeleewarya Annabiya: ‘Kanda heu Faara ni a tsahang kanda ha.’ Kala niifa kangga thlǝmaarha Chinɗa fa, tǝ ƙǝm tsahagha a haarghǝn, nǝn ɓarha thlǝmanna ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Mbǝ niifa sǝ nagha Chinɗi wa, ƙǝl niifɗi ɓagha hai a thlǝmad Faara, ndǝn nagha Chinɗi. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek nǝghǝn tǝ yibrha mbuwa ngwalaarha. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nggini mburodi yi fǝr yibrha. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Chichiyinun kin nda manna a kaheerha, amma mǝr nda heu. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Amma kulo mburodi yi fǝr yibrha ya ɓagha hai a talara, kala niifa kiigha mbǝ mǝra wa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nggini mburodi ɓagha hai a talara yi fǝr yibrha. A kii niifa mburodi ɗiya, nǝn a tsaurha pa kwanɗǝ. Mburodi ɗiya thlu fadna ni, niya fǝra tǝna ƙǝshiirha wal yibrha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Tǝrgha Yahudayini katǝrangganda ngaala hai a pathlang ndan aten ǝnɗi ndanǝn tsakh mee nda, “Ƙǝƙǝn na niifɗi fǝrang thlu fadghǝn ƙǝmya kim?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, a kiiwun thlu fad Wan niifa tǝ ƙǝm sa farghǝ nun wa, mbun wal yibrha mbuwa ngwalarha wa. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Kala niifa kiigha thlu fadna tǝ sa farna, nǝn tsaurha tǝ yibrha fa mbuwa ngwalaarha, niya thleng kanda sǝ a far ngwala ƙǝshiirha. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Ƙǝsǝr thlu fanna ka ǝnnarhami ni, farna ƙǝm ka ǝn saarha ni. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Kala niifa kiigha thlu fanna tǝ sa farna, nǝn naarha a hurna nggi ƙǝm ahurghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ƙǝla na Chinɗi tǝ yibrha thlǝngga nggi ɓa, ƙǝsǝr ka ndǝghǝnni nani tǝ yibrha, nǝghǝn kee ƙǝm, kala yanɗi na a hǝbrha a fanna, ƙǝsǝr ka nggi, nǝn wal yibrha. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Yanɗiya ndǝna mburodi ɗi ɓagha hai a talara, kala niifa kiigha mburodi ɗi ya nǝn wal yibrha pakwanɗǝ. Mbǝ tur mburodi ɗani kiina chichiyi nun wa, ko nanǝn kee mǝr nda ɗǝ.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Thlǝkka Yeeso ǝnggini ya heu ya ahu sayidɗi nanǝn a tsaharhaha ahu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya na a Kafarnahum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fatsahaya hangga mal nda Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Sǝkna fa tsahayighǝn ndǝn kee, ndanda, “Tsahadɗa ha ya nǝghǝn pǝɗaghǝn kaan. Wunni mbang kang thlǝmaarha fa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Sǝn Yeeso sǝ na fatsahayighǝn a huhurumnda, ndanggǝn kanda, “Tsahadɗa ha ya sǝɓang nǝn hur nun ɗǝ wa? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ma nun a numarha a naɗun Wan Niifa a tǝra a mbǝɗaɗǝ ɓanǝn sa ɓa? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Sǝsǝna katenggǝn ni kee na fǝr yibrha; mbǝ ˈyasǝ na thlu farha mbang ǝnaarha wa. Palthɗi thlǝghang ni kun Sǝsǝna ni tǝ ƙǝm yibrha. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Amma ahur nun na fingya sǝ fǝrwa wa ƙǝkafek tǝ nggi.” (Ƙǝsǝr Yeeso sǝnɗǝ fingya fǝrwa ƙǝkafek tǝghǝn, tǝ ƙǝm sǝnɗǝ niifa na a fǝrghǝn ka a ɓǝlang ngganda.) <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Ɗǝgha mbeeɗǝ tǝ ndaarha, “Ndǝghǝn ɗani ndang ni kun mbǝ niifa sǝ na ɓaarha thlǝmanna ɓa wa, ƙǝl a fǝre Pǝpa kanda.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ƙǝsǝr ka palthɗi thlǝkna Yeeso ya, fa takkwayighǝn hangga malang ngganda mbu samadghǝn.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Tǝrgha tsahangga Yeeso mee kumkap sǝriɗi, “Kun ƙǝm na minnun sǝ wiirha wa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Nggǝrangga Siman Mbiturus sǝ, “Chinǝm, a ɗan thlǝma wun ɗǝ? Sa ni na tǝ laɓar yibrha ha mbuwa ngwalaarha. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Fǝr ɗan ƙǝkafek tǝ ƙǝm sǝnɗansǝ sa ni tǝ Peɗǝnda yi Faara.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Tǝrgha Yeeso nggǝranggǝn sǝ, “Nggi ndǝn wurgha kun kumkap sǝri. Amma tal ahur nun Sheetan ni.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Nǝghǝn a thlǝk laɓar Yahuda, wan Siman Iskaryoti, tal ahur kumkap sǝri ɗi, na a fǝrghǝn a ɓǝlang ngganda.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yeeso tǝ wan manggighǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />A kwasamadghǝn, wiigha Yeeso hai ahur Nggalili, amma mbǝ midghǝn sǝ a ɗǝgha Yahudiya ɗǝ wa, ƙǝsǝr na mid Yahudaya sǝ a ɓǝlangganda. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Nanǝnya far wutsǝfayid Chamngya yi Yahudaya nduwusɗa ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Tǝrgha wan mangya Yeeso ndang ngganda, “Malang mbǝɗiya ɗǝna Yahudiya ɗǝ tǝna fatsahayiwa na ǝnwuteengya na a ǝnaarha. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Mbǝ niifa ɓǝɓeng ˈya hai nǝn a ǝnaarha wa, ana midghǝn sǝ sǝngga fiya ndǝn wa. Nanǝn nagha a ǝna ǝngginiya, kyaɗang fadwa ƙǝshiirha.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ƙǝsǝr ko wan manggighǝn ni fǝr wanda ƙǝkafek a ndǝghǝn wa.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Tsaunǝn kee ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Ɓawa yina sayi ɓa ˈwan wa. Kun kam kala sayi mǝmǝl ni a fad nun. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Mbǝ nafiya ƙǝshiirha kar kun wa, amma na nda a kar nggi fa, ƙǝsǝr ka ni naarha ndaarha na nda a ǝna tar mbǝlfeeya. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Kun ɗaama hu wutsǝfayidɗa ɗǝ. Mbiya ɗǝrha hu wutsǝfayidɗa ɗǝ wa, ƙǝsǝr ɓa wa sayid na ɓa ˈwan wa.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Akwasamadɗi thlǝk nǝn palth ɗiya, tsauka a Nggalili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsahad Yeeso ha hu Ƙǝn Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Amma a kwasamadɗi wiina wan manggighǝn hu wutsǝfayidɗa ɗǝ, ɗǝgha Yeeso ɗǝ ƙǝm, mbǝ a pǝpal wa, amma ɓǝɓee. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />A hu wutsǝfayidɗi nagha Yahudayini a kaɗaghǝn, na nda a tsakhmee, “Na niifɗi a yanggi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />A hu terɗi nagha fiya a kikighǝn fa. Fingya a ndaarha, “Ka niifa ni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Fingya ƙǝm a ndaarha, “Awo, nǝghǝn a nggaɓa fiya ni kee.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Amma mbǝ niifa sǝ na mbang ndikrha a tenggǝn a pǝpal wa, ƙǝsǝr na nda a tǝrǝm Yahudayani. <verse eid="JHN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Kanda a maɗufud wutsǝfayidɗi, tǝrgha Yeeso ɗǝgha ahu pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ katǝranggǝn tsaharha ha. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Yahudayini ƙǝsgha ǝnwulteena kanda tsakhmee nda, “Kamshiɗiya ˈwawa nda tsahang ha wa, ƙǝƙǝn walnǝn sǝnda kiya?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Ənggini niya tsaharha ha ya mbǝ yina ni wa, amma yi Faara ni thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Kala niifa wurgha ǝna ˈya na mid Faara, nǝn a sǝnɗasǝ tsahad na ha yi Faara ni, mbǝ yina ni wa. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Kala nafiya na a ndikrha yi altendan, na mindan sǝ a falgha fiya kanda kee. Amma kala niifa na a ǝna taara ka a falgha fiya niifɗi thlǝngga ndǝn ɓa, nǝn pǝr ƙǝkafek, mbǝ nggaɓaarha wa. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Fǝrangwa na Musa ngyakhrha kun wa? Amma mbǝ niifa sǝ ahur nun ǝnagha taara tǝ ngyahadɗi wa. Kama na minnun sǝ a ɓǝleewun?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Ndangga fiya, “Na ǝnkaheerha sǝ a fad wa, wunni na midghǝn sǝ a ɓǝloghǝn?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Ənaɗi ǝnwulteena tǝtal a far yibrha, ƙǝsgha ǝnwulteena kun. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Malang Musa ngyakhrha kun yi thlee muwa (ko nanǝn kyawa ɓa a mii Musa wa, amma yi chichiyi nun ni), kulo hai mbiya nun thlee muwa a far yibrha. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Anaɗun a thlee muwa a far yibrha, ƙǝsǝr amanun tǝɗang ngyakhrha Musa in, kama na hur nun sǝbrha ɗǝ tǝ nggi ƙǝsǝr ka ƙǝnang ni niifa a far yibrha? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />A ngwa ɗun kumarha yi yirha wa, amma ngwama kumarha yi ƙǝkafek.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeeso ni Ƙǝrǝsti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Fingya na tǝ tsaurha a Urshalima katǝrangganda tsahang mee ndan ha, “Mbǝ niif ɗani na mindan ɓǝlang nda ya wa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Kulo ndǝghǝn ya! A ndikrha a pǝpal, mbangwanda kalang sǝ tǝ ˈya ɗimi wa. Nduwa mamnggini fǝr nda ƙǝkafek ndǝghǝnni Ƙǝrǝsti wa? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Amma sǝnɗǝm mbǝɗi ɓana niifɗi saɓa ya. A ɓad Ƙǝrǝsti ɓa, mbǝ niifa sǝ na a sǝn mbǝɗi kyanǝn saɓa wa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Nana Yeeso a tsaharhaha ahu pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara, tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ, “Nǝghǝn kee, sǝnɗun nggi, tǝ ƙǝm sǝnɗun mbǝɗi kyani saɓa. Mbǝ nggi ɓangga altenna ɓa wa, yanɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa tǝ ƙǝkafek ni tǝ ƙǝm sǝnggun ndǝn wa. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Amma sǝnɗi ndǝn ƙǝsǝr ɓayi ɓa a thlǝmadghǝn, ndǝghǝn thlǝngga nggi a thlǝmad nun ɓa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Tǝrgha mamnggini na mindansǝ a ƙǝsangganda; amma mbǝ niifa sǝ mbangga ɗǝfang haara fa wa, ƙǝsǝr ɓawa sayidghǝn ɓa ˈwan wa. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Amma fingya hangga ahur fiya wumngga hai fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝghǝn ndanda, “A ɓa Ƙǝrǝsti ɓa, ɓanǝn ǝna ǝnwuteengya tǝ ǝnsakhkya hangga ma kamshiɗiya wa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamngya Yahudaya kaɗan nda kwamana a ƙǝsangganda Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Sǝk na Farisaya fad fiya a shishiwarha tǝ ndan aten Yeeso, tǝrgha mamnda firistaya tǝ Farisaya thlǝn fa ƙǝla Ƙǝn Faara nda a ɗaa nda ƙǝsang nda.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Niya tsǝrha tsǝɓaku tǝ kun, a nggǝryi wutta thlǝmad yanɗa ɗǝ thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Nun a kaɗa nggi, amma mbun waleerha wa; mbǝɗi nani sǝ mbun mbang ɗǝrha saɗǝ wa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Ndangga Yahudayini ndan, “Na mid niifɗi ɗǝrha yaaɗǝ ya, ndanǝn mbǝm mbang walang wa? Nduwa nǝn a ɗǝrha mbǝɗaɗǝ welna nafinǝm saaɗǝ tǝ tsaurha ahur Helenaya, ka ɗǝgha tsahang nda Helenaya ha wa? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Mana midghǝn ndaarha, ‘Nun a kaɗa nggi, amma mbun waleerha wa,’ tǝ ƙǝm, ‘Mbǝɗi nani sǝ, mbun mbang ɗǝrha saɗǝ wa’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suhwadya yi fǝr aam yibrha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />A far ngwala wutsǝfayidɗi, ndǝna manda far terɗi, thliigha Yeeso sǝ tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Ana niifa sǝ na tǝ hushimnda fa, ɓagha thlǝmadna ɓa ɓagha saarha. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a nggi, ƙǝla ndana Ɗeleewar Faara, suhwadya na fǝr aam yibrha nǝn a ngǝtta ɓa ahurghǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />A mbǝɗiya na Yeeso a ndaarha Sǝsǝn Faara ni, na fingya a thlǝrha fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a ndǝghǝn. Amma fǝr wanda Sǝsǝna ˈwan wa, ƙǝsǝr fǝrangwa Faara mamnggirha Yeeso wa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngal fiya aten Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Sǝkna fiya palthɗi ndanǝn, ndaagha fingya, “Ƙǝkafek, niifɗiya annabi ɗani.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Ndaagha fingya, “Ndǝghǝnni Ƙǝrǝsti.” Nggǝrgha fingya tsakh mee, “Amma mbǝ ǝnaarha hai kee wa! Ƙǝƙǝn na Ƙǝrǝsti kyarha ɓa a Nggalili ɓa? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Mbǝ ndaagha Ɗeleewar Faara, na Ƙǝrǝsti a ɓaarha ɓa ahu turya Ndauda, nggǝtghǝn nda a Mbaitalami, tala tsauna Ndauda sǝ wa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Tsaunǝn kee, tsakhka mii fiya hai wumngga hai ƙǝsǝr ka Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Fingya na mindan sǝ a ƙǝsangganda, amma mbǝ niifa sǝ ɗǝfangga haara fa wa.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamngya Yahudaya kar nda fǝrƙǝkafek fa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Wudna fa ƙǝla Ƙǝn Faara a thlǝmad mamnda firisya ɗǝ tǝ Farisaya, tsahang mee nda kanda, “Kama ƙǝsang ngwa nun ɓa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Nggǝrang ngganda mamngya firistaya sǝ tǝ Farisaya, “Mbǝ niifa sǝ ˈwagha ndikrha ƙǝla niifɗiya wa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Ndangga Farisayini fa ƙǝla ƙǝnɗa ha, “Kun ƙǝm nggaɓaɗǝ kun wa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Na niifa sǝ tal ahur mamngya Yahudaya nduwa Farisaya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a ndǝghǝn? Awo!” <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Amma nafini wumngga hai shiwang nda kanda ƙǝsǝr sǝngwanda ˈya aten ngyakhrha Musa wa.<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodimus ˈwagha ɗǝrha thlǝmad Yeeso ɗǝ, nǝghǝn tal ahur ndan, tsakh mee nǝn, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“A hu ngyahad nǝm mǝmǝl ni ngwang kumarha nǝm niifa ƙǝm kula ramu ˈya ha ǝna nǝn wa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Nggǝrang ngganda sǝ, “Ɓagha ɓa a Nggalili ƙǝm wa? A karatang na Ɗeleewar Faara ngga na sǝndasǝ tǝ ndaarha ˈwawa Annabi kyarha ɓa a Nggalili wa.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Tǝrgha kowunni wudgha wure ɗǝ. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:53—8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbusǝ ahur fingya ɗeleewarya kaar wa</char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ƙǝsang nda nuneefa a ǝna kulafayirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Tǝrgha Yeeso ɗǝgha wumnda ɗǝfya Dzaitun ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />A tsar ƙǝrǝt nggǝrghǝn wutta a pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara ɗǝ, wumngga fiya thlǝmadghǝn ɓa, tsauka hai nagha a tsahang kanda ha. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Tǝrgha fa malǝmngya ngyakhrha tǝ Farisaya ɓang nuneefa nda ɓa ƙǝsang nanda a ǝna kulafayirha. Ishang ngganda a maɗufun fiya wumngga hai. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Ndangganda Yeeso, “Mala, ƙǝsang ɗan nuɗiya a ǝna kulafayirha. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />A hu Ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa ndǝghǝn tǝtani a muk tur nishyina nan ya tǝ ferya mǝrgha. Nanǝnya, ma ndaana?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Tsahang nanda tur miiɗi ya ka a ɗǝfang takthleera nda, tǝna nda wal kwamana a ƙǝsang ngganda tǝ ɗimiyirha. Amma ɓǝrgha Yeeso hai chirelthgha a hweeɗe tǝ wan haarghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ɗǝna nda mbeeɗǝ tǝ tsahang mee ha, nggǝrghǝn thliirha sǝ ndanggǝn kanda, “Ana niifa sǝ ahur nun ǝnawa ɗimiyirha, katǝranggǝn mukƙǝn hai tǝ feera.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Nggǝrghǝn ɓǝra hai nagha a chireethla a hweeɗe.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Sǝkna nda kee ngǝra nda hai tǝtal, tǝtal ka a ten shing ndǝn ndan ɗǝgha hu yanɗa ɗǝ na ngguchit. Mal Yeeso nda tǝ nuɗi ƙǝt a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Tǝrgha Yeeso nggǝrghǝn thliirha sǝ ndanggǝn nuɗi, “Nuɗiya ai kanda? Asǝ tal ahur ndan mbangga nggo kumarha wa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ndangga nuɗi, “Paɓa, mbǝ niifa sǝ wa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Tǝrgha ndangga Yeeso, “Ko nggini ma nggo yi kumarha sǝ wa, wiu fayiwa a nggǝrna ǝna ɗimiyirha wa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeeso ni kukwaryid ƙǝshiirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Nggǝrgha Yeeso ndang nda fiya, “Nggini kukwaryid ƙǝshiirha. Kala niifa mbuwa samadna mbǝ tam wiirha hai hu wula wa, amma nǝn wal kukwaryid yibrha.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Ndangga Farisayini, “Na thlǝk pathla yi alten wa kee, mbǝ ƙǝkafek sǝ hu ˈya na a thlǝkrha wa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Ko nanǝn nggini a thlǝkƙǝn tǝ altenna, palthɗi niya thlǝkrha atenna ƙǝkafek ni. Ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗi mbǝɗi kyani saɓa tǝ mbǝɗi niya ɗǝrha saaɗǝ. Amma kun sǝnggun mbǝɗi kyani saɓa tǝ mbǝɗi niya ɗǝrha saaɗǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nuwun a ngwe kumarha sǝ yi thlu farha, amma nggi mbǝ niifa sǝ ngwang ni kumarha sǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Amma a ngwaɗi kumarha ma, ˈya niya thlǝkrha mǝmǝl ni, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ nggi katenna na a ǝnaghǝn wa. Amma nggi tǝ Pǝpa thlǝngga nggi ɓa na a ǝnaghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />A hu ɗeleewar ngyahad nun nǝghǝn chichirethlee hai tǝ ndaarha, nafiya sǝri a fǝr nda sheeda ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Nggi fǝrɗi sheeda a tenna, Pǝpa thlǝngga nggi ɓa ƙǝm fǝrɗǝ sheeda atenna.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Tǝrgha tsahang mee nda, “Ai tsu?” Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Tsaunǝn sǝnggun nggi wa, Pǝpa ma mbun sǝnggǝn wa. Andam sǝnɗun nggi, nun sǝn Pǝpa ƙǝm.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Thlǝkƙa Yeeso palthyini ya nanǝn a tsaharhaha a pǝpal Ƙǝn Faara, tsau tǝ mbǝɗi na nda ɗǝf wuɗǝɓǝl fǝra sǝ a Faara. Amma ƙǝsang ngwanda wa, ƙǝsǝr ɓawa sayidghǝn ɓa wa.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Tǝrgha nggǝrgha Yeeso ndang nda kanda, “Niya wiirha, ɓanun kaɗa nggi, nun a mǝra kee hu ɗimiyid nun. Mbǝɗi niya ɗǝrha saaɗǝ mbun mbang ɗǝrha ɗǝ wa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Tǝrgha tsakhka mamngya Yahudayini mee, “Na midghǝn sǝ a ɓǝlanggǝn fadghǝn wa? Mani nǝn a ndaarha, ‘Mbǝɗi niya ɗǝrha saaɗǝ mbun mbang ɗǝrha ɗǝ wa’?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Kun nuwun a hweeɗe ɓa, amma nggi niyi a talara hai. Kun yi ƙǝshiirha ni, nggi mbǝ yi ƙǝshidɗa ni ya wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ndǝghǝn ɗani ndang ni kun wu nun a mǝra hu ɗimiyid nun; ƙǝl a fǝrɗun ƙǝkafek tǝ ndaarha nggini ndani nggini, a mbǝ kee wa nun a mǝra ahu ɗimiyid nun.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Tsahang mee nda, “Wunni sa?” Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Nggini ƙǝla ni naarha pǝrang nda kun ka ƙǝtǝm. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Na fingya ǝngya sǝ hangga na minna thlǝkrha a tennun, tǝ ƙǝm ngwang kumarha ni kun sǝ a tenggǝn. Amma mbiya ǝnaghǝn wa, ƙǝsǝr thlǝkki ˈya kee sǝk ni hai a mii niifɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa, tǝ ƙǝm tǝ ƙǝkafek ni.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Amma sǝngwanda sǝ nǝghǝn a thlǝghang ˈya kanda a ten Chin wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ndaagha Yeeso, “A sayidɗi tǝrang nun Wan Niifa a ten kaɗiirha sǝ, a mbǝɗa ni nun a sǝnda sǝ nggini. Mbǝ ˈyasǝ ni mbang ǝnaarha tafanna wa, amma ni thlǝk ˈya tsahe na Pǝpa ha kee. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Amma niifɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa nǝghǝn a thlǝmanna; malwa nggi katenna wa, ƙǝsǝr ni naarha ǝna ǝngya mbǝnangga hur.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />A hu sayidɗi nǝn naarha thlǝk ǝnggini ya, fingya hangga fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝghǝn.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƙǝkafekkirha ndǝna a hǝrworha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Ndangga Yeeso nafini fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝghǝn, “A ƙǝsɗun tsahad na ha kunni na fatsahayina yi ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Nun a sǝn ƙǝkafek, na ƙǝkafek ɗi ƙǝm a hǝrghang kun.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nggǝrangganda sǝ, “Kan chichiiya Ibrahim ni, ˈwa wan tsau mafayirha aki niifa hu ƙǝshidɗiya wa. Ƙǝƙǝn na ndaarha na hǝrghang kan?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kala niifa na ǝna ɗimiyirha mafad ɗimiyirha ni. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mafarha mbǝ mbǝd tsawudghǝn ni ahu wure pakwanɗǝ wa, amma wan wure wurighǝn ni pakwanɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ana Wanɗa ni hǝrghangga kun, ƙǝkafek wal ɗun hǝrǝkrha. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Sǝnɗisǝ kun chichiya Ibrahim ni. Amma na minnun sǝ a ɓǝleewun, ƙǝsǝr laɓar na kyawa hur nun hai wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Niyi a pǝrang ˈya kun keɗee na Pǝpa, amma kun nuwun a ǝna ˈya ndang na chinun kun.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Ndangganda, “Ibrahim ni chinan.” Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Ana wangya Ibrahim ni kun, kam ǝnaɗun ǝnggini ǝnana Ibrahim. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />A meghedghǝn na mid nun sǝ a ɓǝleewun ka pǝrang ni ƙǝkafek kun pǝree na Faara. Ənawa Ibrahim kee wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Nuwun a ǝna ǝnggini ǝnana china.” Nggǝrangga nafini Yeeso sǝ, “Kan mbǝ wangya mǝterya ni wa, Chinan tal ni ndǝna Faara tafadghǝn.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wangya Sheetan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Andam Faara ndǝna chinun, kam nggǝmɗun nggi fa, ƙǝsǝr ɓayi ɓa a thlǝmad Faara nanǝnya, kulo nggiya. Ɓayi ɓa tǝ sǝsǝmnda altenna wa; amma ndǝghǝn thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Mani mbuwa nun a sǝnang ǝnɗa hai niya thlǝkrha? Ƙǝsǝr mbun a mbang ƙǝrǝs sǝk tsahad na ha wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Kun yi chinun, sheetan ni, na minnun sǝ a ǝna ǝnɗanun na midghǝn. Ka a katǝradghǝn tǝ ɓǝl farha ni, djiɗangwa ˈya tǝ ƙǝkafekkirha wa, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ ƙǝkafek sǝ a fadghǝn wa. Anaɗǝ a nggaɓaarha, pǝr nǝn ǝn ǝnadghǝn, ƙǝsǝr tǝ nggaɓaarha ni, chin fa nggaɓaya ƙǝm. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ka pǝrang ni ƙǝkafek kun, ndǝn kar nun fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ nggi! <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Wunni ahur nun na mbang kyad ˈya ˈwani ǝna ɗǝmiyirha a tenggǝn? A naɗi a pǝr ƙǝkafek, kama nda mbuwa nun fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ nggi? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Niifa na yi Faara nǝn sǝk ya na Faara a thlǝkrha. ˈYa ǝnagha ndǝn mbuwa nun a sǝkƙǝn ƙǝsǝr mbǝ yi Faara ni kun wa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kal Yeeso Ibrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ndangga Yahudayini, “Nanǝn kee, ƙǝkafek ni nda nan tǝ Samariyarha ni sa naa tǝ ǝnkaheerha fa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Mbǝ ǝnkaheerha sǝ a fadna wa, ni fǝrang mamnggirha Pǝpa, amma kun sarɗun nggi. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Mbiyi a kaɗan mamnggirha altenna sǝ wa; amma na yanɗa sǝ na midghǝn sǝ a maneegha nda, ndǝghǝnni tǝ ngwa kumarha. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kala niifa ƙǝsgha laɓarna ha, mbǝ tam mǝra wa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ndangga Yahudayini, “Nanǝnya sǝnɗansǝ na tǝ ǝnkaheerha fa! Mǝr Ibrahim tǝ ƙǝm mǝr annabiya, amma nana a ndaarha, kala niifa ƙǝsgha laɓar wa ha mbǝ tam mǝra wa. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Na a ndaarha kalna chinan Ibrahim wa? Mǝrɗǝ, annabiya ƙǝm mǝr nda. Naa a ndaarha wunni sa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “A manang ɗi altenna, mamnggid ɗiya mbǝ a mii ˈya wa. Amma pǝpa ndanun ndǝghǝnni Faar nun, ndǝghǝnni na a maneerha. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ko nanǝn sǝnggun ndǝn wa, amma sǝnɗi ndǝn. A nda ɗi sǝngwi ndǝn wa, niya tsaurha tǝ nggaɓaarha ƙǝla kun, amma sǝnɗi ndǝn tǝ ƙǝm ƙǝs ɗi laɓarghǝn ha. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Chinun Ibrahim kukwasang ɗa fa ka a naa ɓad na nǝn ɓa. Na ɗa ndǝn, tǝ ƙǝm tǝkɗǝ mbǝnda fa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Ndangga Yahudayini “Sǝlwa hurad wa kumggit tuf wa, ƙǝƙǝn na ndaarha nanna Ibrahim?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ “Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kapa na nda nggǝt Ibrahim, niyi sǝ!” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Thlǝkna Yeeso palthɗi ya kee, haar ferya nda ka a mukƙǝn nda. Amma ɓǝɓeegha Yeeso kyagha sǝ ma Ƙǝn Faara.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Ƙǝnang Yeeso niifa nggǝt nanda kwamarǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Nana Yeeso a wiirha hai, na niifa nǝn nggǝt nanda kwamarǝn. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Tsahangga fatsahayighǝn mee, “Mala, yanggini ǝnagha ɗimiyirha nggǝt nanda niifɗiya kwamarǝn, ndǝghǝn wa nduwa fa nggǝtyighǝn?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Mbǝ niifɗiya nduwa fa nggǝtyighǝn ǝnagha ɗimiyirha wa, amma nggǝt na ndan kwamarǝn tǝna nda kyad tar Faara a tenggǝn. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Nanǝn ɓalgha yanfaara sǝ, tǝta ni a fad nǝm a ǝna tar niifɗa nǝm thlǝngga nggi ɓa. Fǝɗikrha a tsǝrha hai, mbuwana niifa mbang ǝna taara a fǝɗikrha. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Nani hu ƙǝshiirha, nggini kukwaryid ƙǝshiirha.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Tǝrgha chakh yakhrha nǝn hweeɗe hai, tǝtǝnanggǝn tabrha tǝ yahadghǝn, ƙǝmanggǝn a yid niifɗi. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Ndanggǝn niifɗi, “Ɗuwa ɗǝ ɗa tsaɓang yidwa ɗǝ ahu wutambar Siliyom” (Siliyom ndaarha ni thlǝnda) tǝrgha ɗǝgha niifɗa ɗǝ tsaɓanggǝn yidghǝn ɗǝ, wudgha ɓa nagha a na mana hai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kufad Silom na fiya ɓarha sa ɓa ka a wal ƙǝnda nda</char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Tulayighǝn tǝ fingya nafiya na naarha naghǝn a hwanda tsakh mee nda, “Mbǝ niifɗa ni ya na tsaurha hai nagha a hwanda wa?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Ndagha fingya ndǝghǝnni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Fingya ƙǝm ndanda, “Awo, mbǝ ndǝghǝn ni wa thlǝnǝn ndǝn kee.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Amma ndǝghǝnggi nagha a ndaarha, “Nggini niifɗi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Tsahang mee nda, “Mani nanǝnya na a naa mana hai?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ndanggǝn kanda, “Niifɗi na nda aarha Yeeso tǝtǝnangga tabrha ƙǝmee ƙǝnǝn a yidna ndeeghǝn, ‘Ɗuwa hu kufad Siliyom ɗǝ tsaɓangga yidwa ɗǝ.’ Ɗiyaɗǝ tsaɓanggi yidna ɗǝ, hǝrǝm ni tsaɓang yidna ɗǝ, ƙǝlee hai kee nggi a na mana hai!”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Tsahang mee nda, “Nǝghǝn a yanggi nanǝnya?” Nggǝranggǝn kanda sǝ, “Sǝngwi mbǝɗi nanǝnsǝ wa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsahang Farisaya mee niifɗi kwamanɗi ƙǝnnǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Tǝrgha ɗǝnda tǝ niifɗi tamngga kwamarǝn a thlǝmad Farisaya ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />A far yiɓǝd Yahudaya ni tǝtǝnang na Yeeso taɓadɗi inang nǝn yid niifɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Tsaunǝn kee, Farisayini ƙǝm tsahang mee nda kwamadɗi walgha ƙǝnda. Ndangga niifɗi kanda, “Tǝtǝnanggǝn tabrha ƙǝmee ƙǝnǝn a yidna, ɗǝni tsaɓang nda ɗǝ ƙǝlee hai kee nggi a na mana hai!”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Ndagha fingya Farisaya, “Niifɗiya ɓawa ɓa a thlǝmad Faara wa, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn a ǝna taara a far Yibrha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Ndagha fingya, “Amma ƙǝƙǝn na tǝ ɗimirha ǝna ǝnwulteena ƙǝla yanɗiya?” A mbǝɗiya tsakhka mii ndan hai.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Tǝrgha nggǝrgha Farisayini tsahang mee niifɗi, “Tsau nǝn inang ɗǝ yidwa ɗǝ, sa a naa mana hai, mana mbang ndaarha aten niifɗi ƙǝnowa ya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Nggǝranggǝn kanda sǝ, “Annabi ni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Yahudayini fǝrwanda ƙǝkafek kwamarha ni niifɗiya kaar na a naa maana hai nanǝnya wa, thlǝn farha nda a aah fa nggǝtyighǝn nda ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Tsahang mee nda kanda, “Wanun niya wa? Ndawun nggǝt wun ndǝn kwamarǝn, ƙǝƙǝn nǝn a naa maana hai nanǝnya?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Nggǝrangga fa nggǝtyighǝn kanda sǝ, “Sǝnɗansǝ wanan ni ya tǝ ƙǝm nggǝtghan ndǝn kwamarǝn. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Amma kan kam sǝngwan kwamanɗi wal nǝn, nǝn a na maana hai nanǝnya wa, nduwa niifɗi inangga yidghǝn ɗǝ wa. Tsahaman mee lee, mbǝ wundakhne ni wa, nǝn mbang thlǝkƙǝn tǝ miighǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />(Thlǝkna fa nggǝtyighǝn ndǝn kee ƙǝsǝr na nda a tǝrǝm Yahudaya, ƙǝsǝr nggǝmnda fa tǝ ndaarha kala niifa ndagha Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ni na nda a rǝghang ɗǝ ma ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya.) <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ndǝn ndaana fa nggǝtyighǝn, “Mbǝ wundakhne ni wa; tsahaman mee.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Nggǝrgha nda aah niifɗa ɓa nggǝt na nda kwamarǝn kaar, ndangganda, “Fǝrang mamnggirha Faara pǝr ƙǝkafek na, ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗansǝ niifɗi ƙǝnogha ya tǝ ɗimirha ni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Nggǝranggǝn kanda sǝ, “Tǝɗimirha ni nduwa mbǝ tǝɗimirha ni wa mbi sǝnda wa. Amma ˈya sǝnni sǝ, kaar niyi kwamarǝn, nanǝnya nggi a na mana hai!”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Tǝrgha tsahang mee nda, “Mani ǝno nǝn? Ƙǝƙǝn inang nǝn yidwa ɗǝ?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Nggǝranggǝn kanda sǝ, “ˈWaɗi teena pǝrangɗi ndǝn kun, nggǝmnggun fa wa. Mani na mid nun a nggǝr wun sǝƙƙǝn faɗǝn? Nduwa kun ƙǝm na mid nun sǝ a tsawun fatsahayighǝn wa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Tǝrgha ˈyarghǝn nda, ndanda, “Sa ndǝna tǝ tsahadghǝn, amma kan fatsahaya Musa ni. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Sǝnɗansǝ ndik Faara tǝ Musa, amma niifɗiya sǝngwan mbǝɗi kyanǝn saɓa wa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Nggǝrangga niifɗi kanda sǝ, “Kulo ǝnwulteena a weeriya! Ine yidna nǝn ɗǝ amma ndon sǝnggun mbǝɗi kya nǝn saɓa wa? <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Sǝnɗǝm sǝ Faara mbǝ kang thlǝmaarha faɗimiya fa wa, amma nǝn kang thlǝmaarha nafiya fa na a fǝrang mamnggirha tǝ ƙǝm ǝna ˈya nda na midghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ka ǝnana nda ƙǝshiirha ˈwa wum sǝk ndaarha na niifasǝ ˈwagha inang yid kwamarha ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />A mbǝ ɓana niifɗa ɓa a thlǝmad Faara ya wa, mbǝ mbang ǝna ˈya kiya wa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Nggǝrang ngganda sǝ, “Sa nggǝt nanda tǝɗimirha, na midwa sǝ a tsahangga kan ha wa?” A mbǝɗi kee rǝkƙǝn nda ƙǝshaaɗǝ ma ƙǝn tsahadɗa ha.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwamayid Sǝsǝna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Sǝkna Yeeso ndaarha rǝk ndan, ɗǝgha wal niifɗi ndanggǝn, “Fǝrna ƙǝkafek tǝ Wan Niifa wa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Nggǝrangga niifɗa sǝ, “Paɓa, wunni niifɗi? Pǝreƙǝn tǝni fǝrƙǝkafek a ndǝghǝn.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Nanǝnya nannan, ndǝghǝnni na a kalo sǝ nanǝnya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Tǝrgha ndagha niifɗi, “Chinǝm, fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek.” A mbǝɗi kee tǝrang shilee nǝn Yeeso in.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Ɓani ka ngwa kumarha hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa, tǝna kwamaya na maana hai fingya na a naa maana hai tsawa nda kwamaya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Fingya Farisaya na tsau tǝ thlǝmadghǝn sǝk nanda kee tsahang mee nda, “Yo! Naa a ndaarha kan ma kwamaya ni wa?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Ana kwamaya ni kun, kam mbuwun tǝ ɗimiyirha fa wa. Amma nanǝnya nuwun a ndaarha nuwun a naa maana hai, ɗimiyid nun tsauɗǝ.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Karapu a ten tǝlafrha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Ɗǝgha Yeeso mbeeɗǝ tǝ ndaarha “Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kala niifa kyagha hu chiɓǝd chauraya hai mbǝ tǝ kwatkirma wa, amma kyagha sa hai tǝ mbǝrha pak, ngaara ni tǝ ƙǝm tǝfasa farha. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Amma niifɗi kyagha sahai tǝ kwatkirma ndǝna tǝ laf chaukhrayini. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Tǝƙǝla kwatkirǝm ɗa ha nǝn a inanggǝn hai, chaukhrayini sǝnda uradghǝn. Nǝn aah chaurayighǝn tǝ thlǝm ndan kyanggǝn kanda ƙǝshaaɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />A kyang ɗǝ yighǝn chaukhraya ƙǝshaaɗǝ heu, nǝn a naarha a mbee mbu samadghǝn nda, ƙǝsǝr sǝnda uradghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Amma mba nda mbu samad ronga wa, ƙǝkafek na nda ɗaarha ma thlǝmadghǝn ƙǝsǝr sǝnang ngwanda urad ronga hai wa.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Tǝ karapu thlǝghang na Yeeso laɓarɗi kanda sǝ ya, amma sǝnangwanda ten karapu ɗa hai ndanǝn wa.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeeso ni ka tǝlafrha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Nanǝn kee, nggǝrgha Yeeso ndaarha, “Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, nggini kwatkirǝm chaukhrayini. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Nafiya heu ˈwagha ɓa ma nggi ngaarya ni tǝ fa fasa faya, amma chaukhrayini kangwanda thlǝmaarha kanda fa wa. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nggini kwatkirǝm ɗi; niifa kyagha ɓa tǝ thlǝmanna nǝn a wal hǝrǝkrha. Na nda a kyarha sahai kya nda sǝ, na nda a lafrha. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Na ngaara kyarha ɗǝ ka ɗǝgha ngaara, ɓǝl farha nǝn tǝ ƙǝm sǝɓanggǝn ǝngya ɗǝ. ˈYa ɓeegha ɓa ka a fǝr yibrha ni, yibrha na lǝlǝgɗa.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Ka niifa ni nggi mbangga lafrha. Niifa mbangga lafrha nǝn fǝr yiɓǝdghǝn ka chaurayighǝn. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Tǝ laf wuɗǝɓǝla, mbǝ tǝlafrha ni wa, tǝ ƙǝm mbǝ yighǝnni chaukhrayini wa. A naɗǝ mǝmeere ɓayi, nǝn ɗaarha mal chaurayina nǝn. Tǝrgha mǝmeere ɗi nǝn ƙǝsang kanda hǝhathlanggǝn kanda ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Tǝ laf wuɗǝɓǝlɗi ɗaa nǝn ƙǝsǝr ɓanǝn ka laf wuɗǝɓǝla ɓa kee, mbǝ ˈyasǝ djiɗangga tǝ chaukhrayini wa.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />“Nggini tǝlafrha na ngga, sǝnɗi chaurayina, chaurayina ƙǝm sǝnda nggi, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />ƙǝla sǝnna Chinɗi nggi; nggi ƙǝm sǝnɗi Chinɗi tǝ ƙǝm fǝrɗi yiɓǝdna ka chaukhrayini. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Na fingya chaurayina sǝ mbuwa ahur chiɓǝd ɗiya. Tǝtani ƙǝm a ɓeeɓa tǝ kanda. Na nda kang thlǝmaarha uradna fa, na nda a tsaurha chibrha tal, tǝlafrha ƙǝm tal. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Ƙǝsǝr ka ǝngginiya ndǝn nggǝmna Chinɗi nggi, ƙǝsǝr nggǝmɗi fa a fǝr yiɓǝdna ni, tǝni nggǝr thlǝghǝn ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Mbǝ niifa sǝ na thlang sǝ a harna wa, ƙǝsǝr nggi tǝ altenna ni na a fǝrghǝn. Na sǝsǝmnda sǝ a harna na a fǝrghǝn ni, tǝ ƙǝm nggǝryi thlǝghǝn ɓa. Sǝsǝmndǝ ɗiya thlǝyi ndǝn ahar Pǝpa.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Thlǝkna Yeeso laɓarɗi kee, nggǝrgha mii Yahudayini tsakhrha hai sǝri. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Fingya hangga ahur ndan ndanda, “Na ǝnkaheerha sǝ a fadghǝn, tǝ ƙǝm tǝpabirha ni. Kama nda nun kang thlǝmaarha fa?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Amma nagha fingya a ndaarha, “Niifa na tǝ ǝnkaheerha fa mbǝ thlǝk pathla kiya wa! Ƙǝƙǝn na ǝnkaheerha inang yid kwamarha ɗǝ?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Karnda Yeeso fa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Nanǝnya ndǝri mbiirha ni, a Urshalima na nda a ǝna wutsǝfayid fǝr Ƙǝn Faara. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yeeso a wiirha hai hu ƙǝn Faarɗi a mbǝrha na nda aarha Mǝthlǝm Sulemanu. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Tǝrgha Yahudayini wuma nda a thlǝmadghǝn heu, ndang ngganda, “Pakwanɗǝ na mal kan ahu wula? Ana sa ni Ƙǝrǝsti pǝranggǝn kan a pǝpal lee.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Pǝrangɗi ndǝn kun, amma fǝr wun ƙǝkafek wa. Əngya ǝnani ahu thlǝm Pǝpa ndǝn kyadgha ndaarha tǝ wunni nggi. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Amma fǝr wun ƙǝkafek wa, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ chaurayina ni kun wa. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Chaurayina na nda sǝk ˈya niya thlǝkrha, sǝnɗi kanda, tǝ ƙǝm na nda mbu samadna. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Fǝrang ɗi yibrha kanda mbuwa ngwalaarha, mba nda tam mǝra wa, mbǝ niifa sǝ na thlang kanda sǝ a harna wa. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Pǝpa fǝreegha kanda kalɗǝ kowunni heu, mbǝ niifa sǝ na mbang thlang kanda sǝ a haar Chinɗi wa. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Nggi tǝ Chinɗi nan tal.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Nggǝrgha Yahudayini har ferya ɓa ka a mukƙǝn nda. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Amma ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Kyaɗang ɗi tarya kun hangga na nggǝngga a thlǝmad Pǝpa ɓa. Aten yanggini na minnun muk nggi kamanggǝn?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Nggǝrang ngganda sǝ, “Mban a muk sa ka ǝngya na nggǝngga ǝnana wa, amma ka laɓar sar farha ǝnana a Faara, ƙǝsǝr sa niifa ni kee, nana a mǝmǝlang fadwa tǝ Faara.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Mbǝ nǝghǝn chichireethlee hai ahu ɗeleewar Ngyahad nun ndaana Faara, ‘Ndayi, faarya ni kun!’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Mba tam ngal Ɗeleewar Faara wa, a ndik Faara tǝ nafini, aah kanda nǝn faarya, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />nggi kam, Pǝpa wurgha nggi thlǝn nǝn nggi hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa. Ƙǝƙǝn nun ndeerha sarɗi Faara ƙǝsǝr ka ndaani, ‘Nggini Wan Faara’ wa? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />A fǝrɗun ƙǝkafek a nggi wa, a mbi a takkwa ˈya ndeena Pǝpa a ǝnee wa. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Amma a ǝnaɗi kanda, ko nanǝn fǝreewun ƙǝkafek wa, kamɗǝ a fǝrƙǝkafek nun tǝ ǝnwultenggini ǝnani, tǝrgha nun a sǝndasǝ tǝ ƙǝm kukwalang nggun hai tǝ ndaarha Pǝpa nǝghǝn a hurna, nggi ƙǝm ahur Pǝpa.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Na mindansǝ a nggǝrgha nda ƙǝsang nda, amma thlǝ farha nǝn a haar ndan.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Tǝrgha Yeeso wudgha samaarha ɗǝ a pǝm kufad Urdun ɗǝ a mbǝɗaɗǝ ˈwana Yahaya ǝna mbaptisǝma sǝ. Tsauka a mbǝɗi ˈwan. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Ɓagha fiya thlǝmadghǝn ɓa hangga. Ndanda, “Ko nanǝn ˈwawa Yahaya ǝna ǝnwulteena wa, amma ǝngya heu ˈwana Yahaya thlǝkrha a ten niifɗiya ƙǝkafek ni.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />A mbǝɗi fiya hangga fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a Yeeso. Yeeso.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Mǝrra Liyadzuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Na niifa sǝ thlǝmnggǝnni Liyadzuru mbǝ kanglangwa. Nǝghǝn tǝ tsaurha a Mbetani tal nda Mairamu tǝ Marthla. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mairamu ɗiya ndǝna wanman na Liyadzuru na kalth hadghǝn, ndǝghǝnni irangga urdi Chinǝm fa a sarghǝn panggǝn ɗǝ tǝ was tenggǝn. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Wutarayini kyab na a wanmanggi ya thlǝnang laɓara nda Yeeso ɗǝ tǝ ndaarha, “Chinǝm, niifɗi tǝ nggǝm nana mbǝ kanglang wa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Sǝkna Yeeso laɓarɗi ndǝghǝn, “Wanhad ɗiya mbǝ a ɓǝlang wa. Katǝra nǝn hai kee ka a manangganda Faara, tǝ ƙǝm walgha Wanggǝn mamnggirha a fadghǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Nggǝm Yeeso Marthla tǝ wanman, tǝ ƙǝm Liyadzuru. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ko nanǝn sǝkɗǝ ndaarha mbǝ Liyadzuru kanglang wa, nggǝrghǝn tsaurha yi ɓeena sǝri a mbǝɗi nanǝn sǝ.<verse eid="JHN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Tǝrgha ndanggǝn fatsahayighǝn, “Taama wuɗǝm Yahudiya ɗǝ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Ndangga fatsahayighǝn, “Amma Mala, ahu ɓenggini mbǝrgha ɗǝ na mid Yahudaya sǝ muk sa tǝ ferya, na midwa sǝ a nggǝrgha wutta mbǝɗaɗǝ?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Mbǝna sayi kumkap sǝri ahu paara wa? Niifa na wiirha hai a yanfaara mbǝ kisaara wa, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn a na maana hai tǝ kukwaryid ƙǝshidɗiya. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Amma ana niifa a wiirha hai a fǝɗikrha, nǝn kisaara, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ tǝ kukwaryirha wa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />A kwasamadɗi thlǝknǝn palthɗiya, ɗǝgha mbeeɗǝ tǝ ndang nda kanda, “Pashid nǝm Liyadzuru a shii ɓeena; amma niya ɗǝrha mbǝɗa ɗǝ ɗi mekhneng sǝ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Ndangga fatsahayighǝn, “Chinǝm, ana nǝn a shii ɓeena, nǝn a ƙǝnda.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yeeso nǝghǝn a ndaarha ni mǝrna Liyadzuru, amma fatsahayighǝn na nda a numad ndagha Yeeso nǝghǝn a shii ɓeena ni.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Tǝrgha pǝranggǝnǝn kanda a pǝpal, “Mǝr Liyadzuru. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Ƙǝsǝr ka kun mbuwa ni a mbǝɗi tǝkɗi mbǝnda fa, ƙǝsǝr nun a fǝrƙǝkafek, nanǝn katǝrana ǝnɗa hai ya mbi a mbǝɗi wa. Amma tama thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tǝrgha Toma (na nda aarha Muɗaarha), ndanggǝn shayighǝn fatsahaya, “Taama ɗǝm ɗǝ ƙǝm, ɗǝm mǝra heu tǝ Yeeso.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeeso ni yibrha tǝ thliirha sǝ hu mǝra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Sǝlna Yeeso ɗǝ, ˈwanda teena pang nda Liyadzuru tǝ ɓeena faɗa. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Mbetani nǝghǝn tsau tǝ Urshalima, sǝlɗǝ kilomita mahan. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Yahudaya hangga ɓagha ka nggab nda Marthla ɓa tǝ Mairamu ka mǝrra wanma ndan Liyadzuru. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Sǝkna Marthla ndaarha Yeeso ɓaghai, kyagha ƙǝshaaɗǝ ɗǝgha hwathlaghǝn fa, amma Mairamu tsauka a wuri.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Ndangga Marthla Yeeso, “Chinǝm, andam kwang naa a mbǝɗiya, kam mǝrwa wanmana wa. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Amma sǝnɗi sǝ ko nanǝnya na Faara furo kala ˈya tsahang nana.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Ndangga Yeeso Marthla, “Na wanmuwa a nggǝr thliirha sǝ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Nggǝrangga Marthla sǝ, “Haˈi, sǝnɗisǝ nǝn a nggǝr thliirha sǝ a mii ngwala ƙǝshiirha na mǝrya a thliirha sǝ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Nggini na thleng mǝrya sǝ, nggini yibrha. Kala fingya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a nggi ko mǝrna nda na nda a thliirha sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Yanɗi ɓalgha tǝ yibrha fǝrgha ƙǝkafek a nggi mbǝ tam mǝra wa. Fǝrna ƙǝkafek tǝ palthɗi ya wa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Ndangga Marthla, “Haˈi, Chinǝm, fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek sani Ƙǝrǝsti, Wan Faara, na a ɓarha hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tǝd Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Akwasamadɗi ndaana Marthla kee, wudgha aah wanman nǝn Mairamu a man patu ɗǝ ndanggǝn, “Ɓa mala ɓa, na midghǝn sǝ a naa sanǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Sǝkna Mairamu kee, thliigha ƙǝkar ɗǝgha walghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Sǝl wa Yeeso hur tal ɗa hai wa, amma tsaukwa a mbǝɗi ƙǝma nǝn tǝ Marthla. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Yahudaya na tsǝtsau a thlǝmadghǝn ahur minda kanda a nggabghǝn, ƙǝlana nda hai thliiɗa sǝ ƙǝkar kyagha ƙǝshaaɗǝ, mbu samadghǝn nda tamngganda ndaarha ɗǝnǝn ka tǝrha aten kwaarha ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Sǝlna Mairamu a mbǝɗaɗǝ na Yeeso sǝ nanǝn ndǝn, fǝlgha hai a mbedghǝn ndanggǝn, “Chinǝm, a ndam nagha a mbǝɗiya, kam mǝrwa wanmana wa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Nana Yeeso ndǝn a tǝrha, tǝ fingya Yahudaya mbuwa samadghǝn ɓa kanda ƙǝm a tǝrha haɗanggǝn fa, sǝbgha hurghǝn ɗǝ ɓillagha kaan. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Tsakhka Yeeso mee, “Panggun a yanggi?” Ndang ngganda, “Ɓoɓa ɓa naghǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Tǝd Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ndagha Yahudayini na ƙǝƙǝt mbǝɗa, “Ƙǝlama hai nggǝmɗa ndǝn kaan!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Amma fingya ndang ngganda ndan, “Niif ɗiya inang ɗǝ yid kwamarha ɗǝ a mbǝɗi taarha. Mbuwa nǝn mbang ˈyaɗang mǝrra Liyadzuru fa wa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thleng nda Liyadzuru sǝ ahu mǝrra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Nggǝrghǝn hur Yeeso sǝbrha ɗǝ kaan ɗǝgha tenkwadɗa ɗǝ. Kaɓeerha ni nggǝlang nanda miighǝn tǝ feera.<verse eid="JHN 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Kwatǝra man ferɗa ɗǝ.” Amma Marthla wanman niifɗi mǝrgha ndanggǝn Yeeso, “Chinǝm, nanǝnya nǝn sǝrha, ƙǝsǝr mǝrghǝn tǝ ɓeena faɗa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Mbǝ ndoyi a fǝrna kǝkafek na a naa mamnggit Faara wa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Nanǝn kee kwatǝrang ngganda ferɗa ɗǝ. Tǝrgha ƙǝlagha Yeeso talara ɗǝ ndǝghǝn, “Pǝpa, usaɗi sa sǝkna hwandǝna. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Sǝnɗisǝ ƙǝtsar na sǝk hwandǝna, amma thlǝk ni yanɗiya ka nafini na ƙǝƙǝt a mbǝɗiya, tǝna nda fǝrƙǝkafek, sǝna nda sǝ sa thlǝngga nggi ɓa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ngwalang na Yeeso thlǝk palth ɗiya, tǝranggǝn uradghǝn sǝ kaan ndǝghǝn, “Liyadzuru kyo ɓa!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Niifɗi mǝrgha kyagha ɓa, nda harghǝn tǝ sarghǝn ƙǝƙǝna tǝ djarra kaɓad paarha, raɓang nda yidghǝn tǝ kaɓad paarha. Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Kwasaman hai wiigha!”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wumang nda mee a ɓǝlang ngganda Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Tsaunǝn kee, Yahudaya hangga na a thlǝmad Mairamu naa nanda ǝnɗi katǝragha hai fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝghǝn.<verse eid="JHN 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Amma fingya ahur ndan ɗǝnda thlǝmad Farisaya ɗǝ ɗa nda pǝrang ˈya kanda ǝnana Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Tǝrgha mamnda firistaya tǝ Farisaya aah farha nda wumang ngganda kognaya hai. Tsahang mee nda ndan, “Ma nǝm a ǝnaarha? Ƙǝkafek niifɗiya ǝnaɗǝ ǝnwulteengya hangga. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />A malang ɗǝm nagha a ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ, tsǝɓaku kowunni nǝn a fǝrƙǝkafek tǝghǝn. Tǝrgha na Romaya a ɓarha ɓa, na nda a thlang Ƙǝn Faarnǝm na chahal heu tǝ nafinǝm.” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Amma tal ahur ndan na nda aarha Kayafa mamnda firis ni ahu huradɗi ndǝghǝn, “Sǝnggun ˈya nun a thlǝkrha wa! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Sǝnggun sǝ wa a nggushi mǝrna niifa tal ka fiya, ma ɓǝlang ngganda fiya ɗǝ kahad.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Laɓarɗi thlǝkna Kayafa ya mbǝ yi altenggǝn ni wa. Tsaunǝn ndǝghǝn ni firis na manggǝn a sayidɗi, thlǝk nǝn ndaarha ɓana Yeeso mǝra ka Yahudaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Mbǝ ka Yahudaya kee wa, amma ka a wumanggǝn ten wangya Faara ɓa heu welgha hu ƙǝshiirha ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Nanǝn kee ka a farɗi, ndǝn katǝrang na mamngya Yahudaya kaɗa kwamana a ɓǝllang ngganda Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Tsaunǝn kee, nggǝrwa Yeeso wiirha hai a pathlang Yahudaya a pǝpal wa. Mal Urshalima nǝn ɗǝgha a mbǝrha ɗǝ tsau tǝ kaheerha fa, ahu tala na nda aarha Ifraimu, tsauka a mbǝɗi tǝ fatsahayighǝn. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Nanǝnya nduwus far wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha ɓa yi Yahudaya, fiya hangga ahu chehwedɗi kahad ˈwanda teena ɗǝnda Urshalima ɗǝ ɓeena hangga kapa na far wutsǝfayidɗi ɓaarha ɓa ka a tsaɓang ngganda alten ndan ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Na nda a kaɗa Yeeso, kanda ƙǝƙǝt ahu Ƙǝn Faara na nda a tsahang mee ndan, “Ƙǝla wun hai ƙǝn? Mbǝ a ɓaarha hu wutsǝfayidɗa ɓa wa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Nanǝnya mamnda firistaya tǝ Farisaya pǝrang ndan fiya tǝ ndaarha, kala niifa nagha Yeeso, pǝrghǝnǝn, tǝna nda ƙǝsang nda.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Irang Mairamu urdi Yeeso fa a Mbetani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Takhƙǝn ɓeena mikki a ǝna Wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha nda, ɗǝgha Yeeso Mbetani ɗǝ tsauka a minda ki Liyadzuru, niifɗi thleng na Yeeso sǝ ahu mǝra. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Fughang ngganda Yeeso sǝ. Marthla ndǝna a fǝr ǝnnarhami ɗǝ, Liyadzuru ƙǝm nǝghǝn ahur nafini hǝbgha ǝnnarhami tǝ Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Tǝrgha Mairamu tǝranggǝn kwalaba urdi sǝ na sǝdghǝn mbǝnggǝn na tǝ wuɗǝɓǝla fa ǝna nanda tǝ ˈya na nda aarha nardi, iranggǝn a ƙǝsǝr sar Yeeso hai panggǝn ɗǝ tǝ was tenggǝn. Tǝrgha lǝghǝdgha hur mindǝɗi tǝ mbǝnda sǝd urdi ɗi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Amma tal ahur fatshayighǝn na nda aarha Yahuda Iskaryoti, (na a fǝr Yeeso), <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />ndǝghǝn, “Na urdi ɗi tǝ wuɗǝɓǝla fa kaan ya, sǝlɗǝ wuɗǝɓǝl rapathlaarha yi paara haru mahan. Kamɗǝ a hiigha ɗǝ, fǝrang wuɗǝɓǝlghǝnda fa yamiya.” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Thlǝk nǝn palthɗi ya mbǝnana fa yamiya a haɗang fa wa, amma ngaara ni, nanǝn ndǝghǝn ni na a ƙǝs wuɗǝɓǝl ndan ha, nǝn naarha ngaara hasǝ ɗanggǝn altenggǝn sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, ndanggǝn, “Malang, tǝnǝn ɗǝfang ɗǝ ka far panna. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Ƙǝtsar na fa yamiya naarha ahur nun, amma mbun naarha tǝ nggi ƙǝtsar wa.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wumang nda mee a ɓǝlang ngganda Liyadzuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wumna Yahudaya hai hangga sǝk nanda ndaarha ɗǝ Yeeso mbǝɗa ɗǝ, thlii nda heu ka ɗa nda naghǝn, mbǝ ndǝghǝn katenggǝn wa amma Liyadzuru thleng nǝn sǝ ahu mǝra. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Tǝrgha mamngya firistaya kaɗa kwaman ɓǝlla Liyadzuru nda ƙǝm, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ƙǝsǝr ka ndǝghǝn ni Yahudaya hangga malgha kanda fǝrƙǝkafek nda tǝ Yeeso.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyad Yeeso a Urshalima hai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ɗalthna mbǝrha hai, fiya hangga wumngga Urshalima ɓa ka wutsǝfayid tǝɗaarha, sǝk ndaarha nda na Yeeso a kwamana ɓayi Urshalima ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Nanǝn kee, kya shii temburu nda kya nda sǝ ɗa nda hwathlaghǝn fa tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ na nda a ndaarha, “Falama Faara! Tǝ parka ni niifɗi ɓagha ɓa ahu thlǝm Chinǝm. Tǝ parka ni Kutǝr Isǝreela!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Walgha Yeeso wan kwaara tǝrgha ƙǝsǝrghǝn sǝ, ƙǝla chireethleng nanda hai, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“A tǝrǝm ɗun wa nafiya Isǝreela. Ƙǝlama ɗǝ Kutǝr nun ɓayi taarha, a ƙǝsǝr wan kwaara.” <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />A katǝradghǝn fatsahayighǝn sǝnangwa nda ǝnɗa hai ya wa. Amma akwasamadɗi manang nanda Yeeso, a ɗal teena nda hai ǝnɗi katǝragha hai ya ˈwan nda chireethla atenggǝn. Tǝ ƙǝm ǝnang ǝnɗa nda fa ya. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Fiya wumngga hai na nda tǝ Yeeso a sayidɗi aah nǝn Liyadzuru a ten kwaarha, thleng nǝn sǝ ahu mǝrra, kanda ni na a pǝranggǝn fingya ɗǝ ǝnɗi ǝnana Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ndǝghǝnni ǝnagha ndǝn kyana fiya ɓa hangga ka hwathlaghǝn nda fa ƙǝsǝr ka ǝnwulteena ǝnanǝn. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Tǝrgha ndangga Farisayini ndan, “Mbǝ ˈya sǝ nǝm mbang ǝnaarha wa. Ƙǝlama hai, ƙǝshiirha heu ɗǝn nda ɗǝ a samadghǝn!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fingya Nggirkaya kaɗan nda Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Na nafiya Nggirkaya sǝ ahur nafini ɓagha ka tǝrang shilee Faara teena a far wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ɗǝnda thlǝmad Filibus ɗǝ, ɓagha ɓa a Mbatsaida na a chehweed Nggalili. Ndang ngganda, “Mbarkama, na minnan sǝ a nang yirha nan Yeeso fa.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Ɗǝgha Filibus ka pǝranggǝn Andrawus ɗǝ. Tǝrgha kanda kyab ɗǝnda thlǝmad Yeeso ɗǝ pǝranggǝn nda. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Ɓad sayi ɓa nanǝnya na a manang ngganda Wan Niifa. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, a hǝfang ngwanda wan hwaliirha hai mǝrgha wa, nǝn tsaurha katenggǝn. Amma a mǝrɗǝ nǝn fǝr wiiya hangga. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Niifa na a nggǝm yiɓǝdghǝn nǝn a ƙǝɗeng nda, niifa ƙǝm kargha yiɓǝdghǝn hu ƙǝshidɗiya nǝn wal yibrha mbuwa ngwalarha. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Kala niifa na a ǝne taara, tǝta ni a mbu samadna nǝn, kala mbǝrha nani sǝ ndǝna mafadna naarha sǝ. Kala niifa na a ǝne taara, na Pǝpa a manang nda.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlǝk Yeeso kwaman mǝrrǝghǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Nanǝnya na yiɓǝdna tǝ ɓillaarha, mani mbang ndaarha? Ndo a ndee ‘Pǝpa, hǝrye ahu sayi sǝsadɗiya?’ Amma ǝnɗa ni ɓani ɓa kamanggǝn ya! <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Pǝpa, manang thlǝm wa!” Tǝrgha sǝk urarha nda hai a talara, tǝ ndaarha, “ˈWaɗi teena manang ɗi, niya nggǝr manang nda.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Fiya wumngga hai sǝkna nanda uradɗi, tamngga fingya ndaarha tǝrˈyaana ni, fingya ƙǝm a ndaarha tǝthlǝnda Faara ni a kalang sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Tǝrgha ndagha Yeeso, “Uradɗi ya ɓanǝn ɓa ka kun ni, mbǝ ka nggi wa. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Nanǝnya sayi ni na a ngwang kumarha nda ƙǝshiirha, nanǝnya ƙǝm na nda a rǝk kutǝr ƙǝshidɗiya. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nggi ƙǝm, a tǝren nda talara ɗǝ ma ƙǝshidɗiya, niya ndusang fiya thlǝmadna ɓa.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Thlǝk nǝn ndǝn kee ka a kyad kwaman mǝrrǝghǝn nǝn. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Ndangga fiya wumngga hai, “Ndangga Ɗeleewar Ngyahad nǝm ƙǝm na Ƙǝrǝsti a tsaurha pakwanɗǝ. Ƙama na ndaarha na Wan Niifa a mǝra? Wunni ‘Wan Niifɗi’ ˈwan?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Tǝrgha nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Na kukwaryirha narha tǝ kun yi sayi ngguchit kee. Weema hai ahu kukwaryidɗi ndǝghǝn ɓalɗǝ tǝ kun, amawana wula tsǝrha hai. Niifa na a wiirha hai ahu wula mbǝ sǝn mbǝɗi nǝn a ɗǝrha saɗǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Fǝrama ƙǝkafek tǝ kukwaryidɗi ndǝghǝn ɓalɗǝ tǝ kun, tǝnun tsaurha wangya kukwaryidɗi.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Yamid fǝrƙǝkafekkid Yahudaya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Akwasamadɗi thlǝk nǝn ǝnggini ya, wiigha Yeeso fayighǝn ɓǝɓenggǝn fadghǝn ma kanda. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ko nanǝn nǝn yakh ǝna ǝnwulteengya a yid ndan, ɓalgha nda kula fǝrƙǝkafek tǝghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Katǝrana ǝnɗa hai ya ka a lǝɗang ngganda ˈya ndaana annabi Ishaya tǝ ndaarha, “Chinǝm, wun fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ laɓar nǝm? Wunni pǝrang na Chinǝm sǝsǝmnggitghǝn?” <verse eid="JHN 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ndǝghǝn ɗani mbangwa nanda fǝrƙǝkafek ƙǝsǝr annabi Ishaya ˈwaɗǝ teena pǝr ɗa ndǝn tǝ ndaarha, <verse eid="JHN 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Kwamang Chinǝm yid ndan, tǝ ƙǝm tsang ɗǝ hur ndan kakrak, amawa nanda naa maana hai, tǝ ƙǝm sǝnang ngganda hai, ɓa nda thlǝmanna ɓa ƙǝnang nggi kanda.” <verse eid="JHN 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Thlǝkna Ishaya palthɗi ya ƙǝsǝr naɗǝ mamnggitghǝn, ndǝn thlǝk nǝn ˈya a tenggǝn. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Fingya hangga ahur mamnggini fǝr nda ƙǝkafek tǝghǝn. Amma kanda a tǝrǝm thlǝkƙǝn a pǝpal, ƙǝsǝr amana Farisaya rǝk kanda ma ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Kanda mindan sǝ a falgha fiya kanda ma yi Faara.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwa kumarha aten laɓar Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Tǝrgha tǝrangga Yeeso uradghǝn sǝ ndǝghǝn, “Kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ nggi mbǝ nggi kateenna fǝree nǝn ƙǝkafek wa, amma fǝr nǝn ƙǝkafek tǝ niifɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Kala niifa nagha nggi, naɗǝ niifɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ɓani ɓa ƙǝla kukwaryirha hu ƙǝshiirha, nanǝn kee kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ nggi mbǝ tam naarha hu wula wa. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Kala niifa sǝkka laɓarna ǝnawa taara sǝ wa, mbi ngwang kumarha wa. Ƙǝsǝr ɓayi ɓa ka ɓi ngwang kumarha ƙǝshiirha wa, amma a hǝrghang nggi. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Amma kala niifa kargha nggi fa tǝ ƙǝm thlǝwa laɓar na fa wa, na niifa sǝ na a ngwang kumarha sǝ. Laɓar ɗi thlǝkni, ndǝna nda a ngwang kumarha sǝ, a far ngwala ƙǝshiirha. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Mbiyi a thlǝk ˈya tǝ sǝsǝmnda altenna wa, amma Chinɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa ndǝn ndeegha thlǝk ǝnɗa ni niya thlǝkrha. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Sǝnɗisǝ a naɗi a ǝna taara tǝ ˈya ndanǝn nǝn ɓang yibrha ɓa mbuwa ngwalarha. Nanǝn kee, niyi a thlǝk kala ˈya ndeena Chinɗi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Tsaɓang Yeeso sar fatsahayighǝn ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Kapa na wutsǝfayid Tǝɗadɗi ɓaarha ɓa, sǝn Yeeso sǝ sayid ɓenggǝn yi mal ƙǝshidɗiya wudgha thlǝmad Chin ɗǝ nduwus ɗaɓa. Nggǝm ɗǝ fatsahayighǝn ahu ƙǝshidɗiya, kyaɗang ɗǝ nggǝmnda kanda pakwanɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />A sayidɗi na Yeeso tǝ fatsahayighǝn a hǝb ǝnnarhami a figrha, ˈwad Sheetan teena kyaɗǝ hur Yahuda Iskaryoti hai wan Siman ka a fǝr Yeeso nǝn. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Sǝn Yeeso sǝ Chinɗi fǝrang ɗǝ ǝngya heu ahu harghǝn hai, tǝ ƙǝm sǝnɗasǝ ɓaghǝn ɓa a thlǝmad Faara, nǝn a nggǝr wutta thlǝmad Faara ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />A sayidɗi na nanda a hǝb ǝnnarhami, thliigha Yeeso sǝ ƙǝɗanggǝn luwudghǝn hai na manggǝn ƙǝn ǝn pafarha nǝn mu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Irr aama nǝn ahu ndaro hai, katǝranggǝn tsaɓang nda sar fatsahayighǝn ɗǝ nagha pang nda saryi ndan ɗǝ tǝ ǝn pafadɗi ƙǝn nǝn a mughǝn. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ɓana Yeeso thlǝmad Mbiturus ɓa, ndangga Mbiturus, “Chinǝm, Sa ni tsaɓang sarna ɗǝ wa?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Nanǝnya mba sǝnang ǝnɗa hai niya ǝnaarha ya wa, amma a mbee ɓa na sǝnggǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Ndangga Mbiturus, “Sa, mba tam tsaɓang sarna ɗǝ wa.” Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “A tsaɓanggi sarwa ɗǝ wa, mba nggǝr tsaurha tǝtsahad na wa.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Ndangga Siman Mbiturus, “Chinǝm, mbǝ sarna katenggǝn na tsaɓang ɗǝ wa, amma tsaɓee haryina ɗǝ tǝ tenna ƙǝm.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “A ˈwad niifa teena fanɗǝ, chilɓi fadghǝn ɗǝ. Ɓalwa midghǝn sǝ fanda wa, ƙǝl a tsaɓanggǝn saryighǝn ɗǝ kee. Kun nuwun chahal, amma mbǝ kun heu wa.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Ƙǝsǝr sǝnɗǝ niifɗi na a fǝrghǝn, ndǝn ndanǝn, “Mbǝ kun heu ni na chahal wa.” <verse eid="JHN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Akwasamadɗi ngwalang na Yeeso tsaɓang saryi ndan ɗǝ, kalang nggǝn luwudɗi na manggǝn tsauka hai. Tsahang mee nǝn kanda, “Sǝnɗun ǝnɗi ǝnani ya wa? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Nun aah nggi ‘Mala’ tǝ ƙǝm ‘Chinǝm,’ mǝmǝl ni, ƙǝsǝr ndǝghǝn ɗa nani. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Nanǝn kee, Nggini Chinǝm tǝ Tǝmalǝm ndǝnun tsaɓang ɗi saryi nun ɗǝ, kun ƙǝm kamɗǝ na a tsaɓang nggun sar ndan ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Əna ni kee ƙǝsǝr kun ma a ǝnon ƙǝla ǝnang ni kun. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, mafarha mbǝ kal turighǝn wa, tǝthlǝnda ƙǝm mbǝ kal niifɗi thlǝngga ndǝn ɓa wa. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Nanǝnya hǝrǝm nun sǝn ǝnggini ya, a ǝna ɗun taara sǝ nun wal parka.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlǝk Yeeso kwaman mǝrrǝghǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Mbǝ aten nun heu niya thlǝk laɓarɗi ya wa, sǝnɗi fingya yini wurni hasǝ. Amma tǝtani a lǝghǝdgha laɓar Faara ndaagha; ‘Yanɗi na a hǝb yadna kyakhree ɗa fa ɓa.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Niya pǝranggǝn kun nanǝnya kapa nǝn katǝrarha hai, a katǝra ɗa hai nun a fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ ndaarha nggini Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kala niifa thlǝgha yanɗa fa thlǝnni ɗǝ thlǝnǝn nggi fa; tǝ ƙǝm kala niifa thlǝgha nggi fa thlǝnǝn niifɗa fa thlǝngga nggi ɓa.” <verse eid="JHN 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Akwasamadɗi thlǝk nǝn palthɗiya, ɓillaɗǝ Yeeso fa kaan ahurghǝn ndǝghǝn, “Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, niifa tal ahur nun nǝn a fǝr nggi.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Tǝrgha nagha fatsahayini a ƙǝlang ndan, wulgha tendan tǝ wunni nǝn a thlǝkrha. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Tal ahur fatsahayini nggǝmna Yeeso tsau a thlǝmadghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Tǝrgha ndangga Siman Mbiturus yanɗi nggǝmna Yeeso kaan, “Tsahang mee wunni nǝn a thlǝk pathla a tenggǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Nanǝn kee ndusangga tǝtsahadɗi Yeeso fa ndanggǝn, “Chinǝm, wunni niifɗi?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Yanɗi niya fǝrang kyad mburodi tawang ni hu aam kyakhna hai ndǝghǝnni.” Tawanggǝn kyad mburodi ahu aam kyakhna hai fǝranggǝnǝn Yahuda wan Siman Iskaryoti ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Hǝrǝm na Yahuda thlǝ kyad mburodi ɗi kee, kyagha Sheetan ahurghǝn hai. Tǝrgha ndangga Yeeso Yahuda, “Ənɗi na midwa ǝnaarha, ǝnoghǝn wed.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Amma ahur ndan mbǝ yanɗa sǝ sǝngga tǝmani ndang na Yeeso kee wa. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Tsaunǝn Yahuda ni tǝ panjakwa wuɗǝɓǝla ha, fingya ahur fatsahayini tamngganda ndaarha na Yeeso a ndang nda a ɗǝgha heng ǝnnarhami kanda ɓa ka wutsǝfayidɗi, nduwa a ɗǝgha fǝrang wuɗǝɓǝla fa yamiya. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Hǝrǝmna Yahuda thlǝ mburodi ɗi kee kyagha hai ƙǝkar a fǝɗikɗi.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thlǝk Yeeso kwaman ngaalla Mbiturus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Akwasamadɗi wiina Yahuda ndagha Yeeso, “Ɓad sayi ɓa na Wan Niifa a ɗǝrha hu mamnggidghǝn ɗǝ, ƙǝsǝr a fadghǝn ni na nda a manang nda Faara. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />A wal Faara mamnggirha a fadghǝn, Faara tǝ altenggǝn nǝn a fǝrang mamnggirha Wanɗi, tsu kee na Wanɗi a wal mamnggirha. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Kun wanggina, takhƙǝn sayi ngguchit kee niya tsaurha tǝ kun. Nun a kaɗa nggi, amma ƙǝla ndang ni mamngya Yahudaya, niya pǝranggǝn kun kee ƙǝm nanǝnya. Mbǝɗi niya ɗǝrha saɗǝ, mbun mbang ɗǝrha saɗǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Niya fǝrang weerǝnda ngyakhrha kun, nggǝmama ndan. Ƙǝla nggǝmni kun, tsauɗǝ tǝta a nggǝm ndan nun. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />A naɗun a nggǝm ndan, na fiya heu sǝndasǝ fatsahayina ni kun.” <verse eid="JHN 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Tsahangga Siman Mbiturus mee, “Chinǝm, ɗǝna yaaɗǝ?” Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Mbǝɗi niya ɗǝrha saɗǝ, mbun a mbu samadna nanǝnya wa, amma tsǝɓaku ndǝn nun a mbu samadna.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Tsahangga Siman Mbiturus mee, “Chinǝm, mani mbuwa ni mbang mbu samad wa nanǝnya? Ngwaɗi fa a mǝri ka sa.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Na a mǝra ka nggi? Niya pǝro ƙǝkafek, kapa na kilngaara tǝtaarha na a ngaal sǝndǝna katǝra mahan.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yeeso ni kwamana a thlǝmad Chinɗa ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Ndangga Yeeso fatsahayighǝn, “A ɓillaɗun wa. Fǝrama ƙǝkafek a Faara, tǝ ƙǝm fǝrama ƙǝkafek a nggi. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />A wuri ki Pǝpa na ƙǝngya sǝ hangga. A mbǝ nanǝn kee wa, kam pǝrang ɗi ndǝn kun. Niya ɗǝrha mbǝɗa ɗǝ ka ɗi tansang mbǝrha kun sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />A ɗiɗi tangsang mbǝrha kun sǝ, niya wutta ɓa ɓi ɗǝrha tǝ kun thlǝmanna ɗǝ. Tǝnun tsaurha a mbǝɗi nani sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Mbǝɗi niya ɗǝrha saɗǝ sǝnɗun kwamana.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Ndangga Toma, “Chinǝm sǝngwan mbǝɗi na a ɗǝrha saɗǝ wa, ƙǝƙǝn nan sǝn kwamana?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Nggini kwamanɗi, nggini ƙǝkafek ɗi, tǝ ƙǝm nggini yibǝdɗi. Mbǝ niifa sǝ na ɗǝrha thlǝmad Chin ɗaɗǝ wa ƙǝl tǝ thlǝmad na. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />A sǝnɗun nggi, nun sǝn Pǝpa. Nanǝnya sǝnɗun ndǝn, tǝ ƙǝm naɗun ndǝn.” <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Tǝrgha Filibus ndanggǝn, “Chinǝm kyaɗang Chinɗi kan, tǝna ten nan ɗathla.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Mǝnɗi ha tǝ kun, amma Filibus ɓalgha kula sǝn nggi? Kala niifa nagha nggi naɗǝ Chinɗi. Kama nda na tsahe mee, kyaɗang Chinɗi kan?” <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Fǝrwa ƙǝkafek niyi hu Chinɗi, tǝ ƙǝm Chinɗi ahur na wa? Laɓarɗi niya pǝrang nda kun mbǝ laɓar altenna ni wa. Amma Chinɗa ni na a hurna, na a ǝna targhǝn. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Fǝreema ƙǝkafek a nda ɗi niyi hu Chinɗi, Chinɗi ƙǝm ahur na. Nduwa ƙǝm fǝrama ƙǝkafek tǝ nggi a ten ǝnwulteengya nanun ǝnani. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, kala niifa fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ nggi nǝn a ǝna tur tarɗi ǝnani. Nun a ǝna ǝngya na mǝmanggǝn kalgha fingya yina mu ya, ƙǝsǝr niya ɗǝrha thlǝmad Chinɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Kala ˈya hwan nun hu thlǝmna niya ǝnaghǝn, tǝna Chinɗi wal mamnggirha a fad Wanɗi. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Kala ˈya hwan nun ahu thlǝmna, niya ǝnanggǝn kun.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗǝfmee yi ɓad Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Ana ɗun a nggǝm nggi, nun a ǝna taara tǝ ˈya pǝrang ni kun. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Niya hwan Pǝpa, ndǝghǝn ƙǝm nǝn a nggǝr fǝrang Tǝthlaara kun na a tsaurha tǝ kun pakwanɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ndǝna Sǝsǝna yi ƙǝkafek. Mbǝ ƙǝshiirha a thlǝghǝn fa wa, ƙǝsǝr ˈwawa nda naghǝn wa nduwa sǝnggǝnda wa. Amma kun sǝnɗun ndǝn, ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn tǝ kun tǝ ƙǝm nǝn narha tǝ kun. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Mbiya mal kun ƙǝla wumirya wa, niya ɓarha thlǝmad nun ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />A mbee shedɗa ɓalwa ƙǝshiirha nggǝr na nggi wa, amma kun nun a na nggi. Nanǝn niyi tǝ yibrha kun ƙǝm nun a tsaurha tǝ yibrha. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />A farɗi nun a sǝndasǝ niyi ahur Pǝpa, kun ƙǝm ahur na, nggi ahur nun. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Nafiya sǝkka ˈya ndani ǝna taara nda sǝ, kanda ni nggǝmngga nggi. Nafiya nggǝmngga nggi, na Pǝpa a nggǝm kanda, nggi ƙǝm niya nggǝm kanda, kyaɗang fanna ni kanda.” <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Tǝrgha Yahuda (Mbǝ Yahuda Iskaryoti wa) ndǝghǝn, “Chinǝm, kama na kyad fadwa a kan kee mbǝ a ƙǝshiirha kahad wa?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Nafiya nggǝmngga nggi, ǝna taara nda tǝ ˈya ndani. Na Pǝpa a nggǝm kanda, niya ɓaarha thlǝmad ndan ɓa tsawi tǝ kanda. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Yi nggǝm ngwa nggi mbǝ a ǝna taara tǝ ˈya ndani wa. Laɓarɗi sǝk nun ya mbǝ nggi thlǝkka ndǝn wa, amma yi Pǝpa ni thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Pǝrang ni ǝnggini kun ya nggi ɓalɗǝ tǝ kun. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Amma tǝthlaara, na Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda, na Pǝpa a thlǝnang ɓa ahu thlǝm na, nǝn a tsahang ǝngya kun ha heu, ɗalang ǝnggina nǝn kun in pǝrang ni kun. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Mal ɗi kun tǝ ɗǝɗemnggirha. Ɗǝɗemnggid na ni fǝrang ni kun. Fǝrang ni ndǝn kun mbǝ ƙǝla na ƙǝshiirha fǝra wa. A ɓillaɗun wa tǝ ƙǝm a tǝrǝm ɗun wa. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Sǝk ɗun ˈya ndaani, ‘Niya wiirha tǝ ƙǝm niya nggǝr wutta thlǝmad nun ɓa.’ A nggǝm ɗun nggi, nun a ǝna wutsǝfayirha ƙǝsǝr niya ɗǝrha thlǝmad Chin ɗaɗǝ, ƙǝsǝr Chin ɗi kalɗǝ nggi mu. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Pǝrang ni ndǝn kun nanǝnya kapa nǝn katǝrarha hai, ƙǝsǝr a katǝra ɗa hai nun a fǝrƙǝkafek. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Mbiya nggǝr kalang kun sǝ hangga wa, ƙǝsǝr kutǝr ƙǝshidɗiya nǝghǝn ɓaghai, mbǝ ˈya sǝ nǝn mbang ǝnaarha a tenna wa. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Amma niyi a ǝna ˈya ndeena pǝpa, tǝna ƙǝshiirha sǝndasǝ nggǝm ɗi Chinɗi. Thlema sǝ tama wiim ma mbǝɗiya.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yeeso ni ka ɗǝf inabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Ɗǝgha Yeeso mbeeɗǝ tǝ ndang nda fatshayighǝn, “Nggini ka ɗǝf inabiɗi, Pǝpa ndǝna tǝhedɗi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kala wuhwaara mbuwa nggǝtta, na Pǝpa a kyathlang ɗǝ. Amma kala wuhwaara na a nggǝtta, na Pǝpa a tansang, tǝnǝn nggǝr chik nggǝtta kaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />ˈWanda teena tangsang nda kun tsauɗun chahal ƙǝsǝr ka laɓarɗi pǝrang ni kun. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Tsawama ahur na, nggi ƙǝm niya tsaurha ahur nun. Ƙǝla mbuwa na wuhwara mbang nggǝtta katenggǝn, ƙǝl a naɗǝ a fad kulghǝn. Kun ƙǝm nuwun kee, mbun mbang ǝna ˈya ngga wa ƙǝl a naɗun ahur na.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Nggini ɗǝf inabi, kun ni wuhwarya. Ana niifa ahur na, niya naarha ahurghǝn, nǝn a nggǝt wan ɗǝfya hangga. Amma a mbǝ tǝ nggi wa, mbǝ mbang ǝna ˈya wa. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />A mbǝ niifa ahur na wa, nǝghǝn ƙǝla wuhwar ɗǝfrha kudmang na nda ɗǝ hwargha, ɓagha fiya ɓa wumang ngganda hwaridghǝn, muwangga nda hu wadɗǝ, djang ngganda ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Amma anaɗun ahur na, laɓar na ƙǝm ahur nun, nun hwan kala ˈya na minnun, na nda a fǝranggǝn kun. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ana ɗun a fǝr wan ɗǝfya hangga, na Pǝpa wal mamnggirha, nǝn a kyad ndaarha kun fatsahayina ni. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nggǝmɗi kun ƙǝla nggǝmna Pǝpa nggi. Nanǝn kee tsawama a ten nggǝmndǝ ɗi kyaɗang ni kun. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />A ƙǝsɗun laɓarna ha, nun a tsaurhahu nggǝm ndǝna, ƙǝla ƙǝs ni laɓar ɗa ha pǝree na Pǝpa, tsauɗi ƙǝm ahu nggǝm ndǝghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Pǝrang ni ǝnggina kun ya tǝ nun wal tur wutsǝfayid na, wutsǝfayid nun ƙǝm tsauka lǝlǝgɗa. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Kulo ˈya ndang ni kun ya, nggǝmama ndan ƙǝla nggǝmni kun. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Mbǝ nggǝmnda sǝ kalgha yanɗiya wa, na a fǝrgha niifa yiɓǝdghǝn ka pashiyighǝn. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Pashiyina ni kun, ana ɗun a ǝna ǝnɗi pǝrang ni kun. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Ɓalwi nggǝr aah kun mafayina wa, ƙǝsǝr mafarha sǝngwa ˈya na turighǝn a ǝnaarha wa. Ameyedghǝn, niya aah kun pashiyina ƙǝsǝr pǝrang ɗi ǝngya kun heu pǝree na Pǝpa. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mbǝ kun wurgha nggi wa, nggi ndǝn wurgha kun, ndanggi kun ɗaamaɗǝ ɗun fǝr wan ɗǝfya hangga na tsaurha pakwanɗǝ. Tǝrgha kala ˈya hwanang nun Pǝpa hu thlǝmna nǝn a fǝranggǝn kun. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Kulo ˈya ndang ni kun ya, nggǝmama ndan.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na ƙǝshiirha a tsan kun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“A tsan ƙǝshiirha kun, a sǝnunsǝ tsanɗǝ nggi kapa nǝn tsan kun. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Andam kun yi ƙǝshiid ɗa ni ya, kam nggǝm ƙǝshiirha ǝnggǝn. Amma tsaunǝn mbǝ yi ƙǝshidɗa ni kun ya wa, wur yi kun sǝ hu ƙǝshiirha, ndǝghǝnni tsanna ƙǝshiirha kun. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Ɗalama teena hai tǝ pathla ndang ni kun, mbǝ mafarha kal turighǝn wa. A sǝsenda, kun ƙǝm na nda a sǝsang kun. Andam ǝnanda taara tǝ ˈya ndang ni kanda, kam ǝnanda taara tǝ ˈya pǝrang nun kanda ƙǝm. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Na nda a ǝnang tur ǝnggina kun fa heu ya ƙǝsǝr ka thlǝmna, ƙǝsǝr sǝngwanda niifɗi thlǝngga nggi ɓa wa. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Andam ɓawi ɓa ɓi kalang kanda sǝ wa, kam mbǝ ɗimiyirha sǝ a fad ndan wa. Amma nanǝnya, mba nda fǝlmee aten ɗimiyindan wa. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Kala niifa tsangga nggi, tsan nǝn Pǝpa ƙǝm. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ənaɗi ǝngya hangga ahur ndan ˈwawana niifa ǝnaarha. Andam ǝnawi ǝnggini ya wa, kam mbǝ ɗimiyirha sǝ a fad ndan wa. Amma nanǝnya nanda ǝnggini ǝnani, ko nanǝn kee tsan nda nggi tǝ Pǝpa ƙǝm. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Lǝghǝd laɓarɗi na chichireethlee hai ahu ngyahad ndan, ndanǝn, ‘Tsan nda nggi fa, kula nggi ǝna ˈya ɗimi.’ <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Amma a ɓa tǝthlaara ɓa, Sǝsǝna na a tsahang ƙǝkafekkid laɓar Faara kun ha, niya thlǝnang nda kun ɓa aki Pǝpa, nǝn a pǝr ˈya heu a tenna. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Kun ƙǝm nun a pǝranggǝn fingya ǝnggini ǝnani ƙǝsǝr ka a katǝradghǝn nuwun tǝ nggi.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Pǝrang ni ǝnggini kun ya amawa nun kyathla hai ma ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Na nda a rǝk kun ahu ƙǝngya tsahad Yahudaya. Mbǝ ngaala sǝ wa, na sayi ɓayi kala niifa ɓǝlangga kun nǝn a numad ndaarha tar Faara nǝn a ǝnaarha. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Na nda a ǝna ǝngginiya, ƙǝsǝr sǝngwanda Chin ɗi nduwa nggi wa. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Pǝrang ni ǝnggini kun ya, a tsǝ sayi hai, nun a ɗal teena hai tǝ ndaarha ˈwaɗi pǝranggǝn kun. Pǝrang ngwi ǝnggini kun ya ka a katǝradghǝn wa ƙǝsǝr ɓal yi tǝ kun.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tar Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />“Amma nanǝnya niya wiirha a thlǝma niifɗa ɗǝ thlǝngga nggi ɓa, mbǝ niifa sǝ ahur nun tsahegha mee ɗini yaaɗǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ƙǝsǝr ka pǝrang ni ǝnggini kun ya ndǝn lǝghǝdna hur nun tǝ sǝbrha hura. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Amma niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, nǝn a tsaurha ngga a fad nun a wiiɗi. Ƙǝsǝr a wii yi wa mbǝ tǝthlaara a ɓaarha ɓa wa, ƙǝl a wii ɗi. Amma a wiiɗi, niya thlǝnanggǝn kun ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />A ɓaɗa ɓa, nǝn a kyaɗang ƙǝkafekkirha nafiya ƙǝshidɗiya aten ɗimiyirha, nggayirha tǝ ngwa kumarha. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Aten ɗimiyirha, ƙǝsǝr kar nda fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ nggi. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Aten nggayirha, ƙǝsǝr niya wiirha thlǝmad Chinɗa ɗǝ, mbun a nggǝr na nggi ɓalwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Aten ngwa kumarha, ƙǝsǝr ˈwad Faara teena ngwang ɗǝ kumarha kutǝr ƙǝshidɗiya. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Na ǝngya sǝ hangga na minna pǝrang nda kun, amma mbun mbang ƙǝsghǝn ha nanǝnya wa. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />A ɓad Sǝsǝn ƙǝkafek ɓa, nǝn a kyaɗang kwaman ƙǝkafek kun heu. Ƙǝsǝr mbǝ laɓar altenggǝn nǝn a pǝrang kun wa, amma nǝn a pǝr ˈya sǝk nǝn, tǝ ƙǝm nǝn a pǝrang ˈya kun ɓalgha ɓayi. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Nǝn a fǝree mamnggirha, ƙǝsǝr nǝn tǝrang ˈya thlǝk ni Pǝranggǝnǝn kun. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Kala ˈya tsauka yi Pǝpa yina ni. Ndǝghǝn ɗa ndani, na Sǝsǝna a pǝrang ˈya ndani kun ndani.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Akwasamad sayi ngguchit mbun a nggǝr na nggi wa, akwasamad sayi ngguchit ƙǝm nun a nggǝr na nggi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sǝbrha hura tǝ wutsǝfayirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Fingya fatsahayighǝn ndang ngganda ndan, “Mana midghǝn ndaarha ndang nǝn ƙǝm, ‘Akwasamad sayi ngguchit mbun a na nggi wa, akwasamad sayi ngguchit ƙǝm nun a nggǝr na nggi’? Tǝ ƙǝm ndǝghǝn, ‘Niya ɗǝrha thlǝmad Chinɗa ɗǝ’?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Ɗǝnda mbeeɗǝ tǝ tsakh mee, “Ma nǝn a ndaarha ‘Akwasamad sayi ngguchit’? Sǝnanggǝm ǝnɗa hai nǝn a thlǝkrha ya wa.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Sǝnangga Yeeso hai na mindan sǝ tsahang mee aten laɓarɗi thlǝk nǝn, ndanggǝn kanda, “Nuwun a tsahang mee ndan ha aten laɓarɗi ndaani, ‘Akwasamad sayi ngguchit mbun a na nggi wa, tǝ ƙǝm Akwasamad sayi ngguchit nun a nggǝr na nggi’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, nun a tǝrha tǝ sǝbrha hura, ƙǝshiirha ƙǝm nǝn a ǝna wutsǝfayirha. Na hur nun a sǝbrha ɗǝ, amma na sǝbrha hur nun a tsaurha ǝn wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Ana nuneefa a nggǝtta hai nǝn tǝk hatta fa kaan, ƙǝsǝr ɓad sayid nggǝttǝghǝn ɓa. Amma a nggǝɗang ɗǝ wufar wee hai, na hatta nggǝttǝɗi mbǝɗang nda, ƙǝsǝr ka wutsǝfayirha nggǝdɗǝ wufar wee hu ƙǝshiirha hai. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Nǝn a tsaurha kee tǝ kun. Nanǝnya sayid sǝbrha hur nun ni, amma niya nggǝr na kun, nun a tsaurha tǝ wutsǝfayirha fa, mbǝ niifa sǝ na thlang wutsǝfayid nun hai wa. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />A farɗi mbun a nggǝr tsahe ˈya wa. Niya pǝrang ƙǝkafek kun, na Pǝpa a fǝrang kala ˈya kun hwanang nun hu thlǝmna. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Pa ka weeriya ˈwawun tsakh ˈya tǝ thlǝmna wa. Hwanama nun a waala, tǝna wutsǝfayid nun lǝghǝtta.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalɗi ƙǝshiirha mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Thlǝkki ǝngginiya tǝ karapuya. Amma na sayi ɓayi niya nggǝr kalang kun sǝ a pǝpal a ten Pǝpa, mbiya nggǝr thlǝk karapu wa. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />A farɗi nun a hwan ǝngya ahu thlǝmna. Mbǝ nggi ni a nggǝr hwan Pǝpa a meyed nun wa. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Chinɗi tafadghǝn nǝghǝn a nggǝm kun, ƙǝsǝr nggǝmɗun nggi tǝ ƙǝm fǝr ɗun ƙǝkafek tǝ ndaarha ɓayi ɓa a thlǝmad Faara. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ɓayi ɓa a thlǝmad Chinɗi ahu ƙǝshiid ɗaɓa ya, nanǝnya niya mal ƙǝshidɗiya wuɗi thlǝmad Chinɗa ɗǝ.” <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Tǝrgha ndagha fatsahayighǝn, “Yauwa! Nanǝnya na a tsǝ laɓaara a pǝpal mbǝ tǝ karapu wa. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Nanǝnya sǝnɗansǝ sǝnna ǝngya heu. Kamngwa a nggǝrgha niifa tsaho mee ha wa. Ndǝghǝn ɗani fǝr nan ƙǝkafek tǝ ndaarha ɓagha ɓa a thlǝmad Faara.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso kanda sǝ, “Fǝr ɗun ƙǝkafek nanǝnya wa? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Amma na farghǝn ɓayi, nanǝnya ma ɓaɗa ɓa, nun a weela hai, kowunni nǝn a ɗaarha wuri keeghǝn ɗǝ. Nun a mal nggi katenna. Amma mbiyi katenna wa, ƙǝsǝr nagha Pǝpa a thlǝmanna. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Pǝrang ni ǝnggini kun heu ya tǝnun wal ɗǝɗemnggirha ahur nun. Nun a sǝsaarha kaan ahu ƙǝshiid ɗiya. Amma ˈwaɗi teena kal ɗi ƙǝshiirha mu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Hwanda Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Akwasamadɗi ngwalang na Yeeso thlǝk ǝnɗiya, ƙǝlagha talara sǝ hwan Faara nǝn ndǝghǝn, “Pǝpa ɓad sayi ɓa na a manang nda Wanɗi, wanɗi ƙǝm manoghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ƙǝsǝr fǝrang na sǝsǝmnda aten kowunni, tǝnǝn fǝr yibrha mbuwa ngwalarha a nafini fǝrang na. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Kwaman ɗa na yi wal yibrha sǝ mbuwa ngwalarha ya, a sǝn sa nan, Faara yi ƙǝkafek, tǝ Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti thlǝnang na hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Manang ɗi thlǝmwa hu ƙǝshiirha, tǝ ngwalang nda tarɗi fǝree na a ǝne. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Nanǝnya, Pǝpa, mane a mbed wa tǝ tur mamnggidɗi nani tǝghǝn kapa na nda ǝna ƙǝshiirha. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />ˈWaɗi teena kalɗi mee atenwa a nafini fǝree na ahu ƙǝshidɗiya. Nafiwa ni, fǝrenna kanda ǝnanda taara tǝ palth wa. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Nanǝnya sǝndasǝ kala ˈya nani tǝghǝn ha kyaghǝn ɓa a haar wa, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />ƙǝsǝr laɓarɗi pǝree nana pǝrang ɗi ndǝn kanda. Thlǝn ndan, tǝ ƙǝm sǝndasǝ ɓayi ɓa a thlǝmad wa, fǝr nda ƙǝkafek sa thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Niyi a hwanda ka kanda, mbiyi a hwanda a ƙǝshidɗiya wa, amma a nafini fǝree nana ƙǝsǝr nafiwa ni. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Kala ˈya nani tǝghǝn yiwa ni, tǝ ƙǝm kala ˈya nana tǝghǝn ha yina ni, ni wal mamnggirha a fad ndan ƙǝm. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Nanǝnya ɓalwa tsawud na sǝ hu ƙǝshiirha wa, amma na nda ahu ƙǝshidɗiya, nggi ƙǝm niya ɗǝrha thlǝmad wa ɗǝ. Pǝpa tǝ Peɗǝnda, lafu kanda tǝ sǝsǝmnda thlǝmwa, thlǝmɗi fǝree nana, tǝna nda tsaurha tal ƙǝla nanǝm tal. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />A sayidɗi nani tǝ kanda, lafɗi kanda tǝ sǝsǝmnda thlǝmwa, thlǝm ɗi fǝree nana. Ƙǝlaɗi kanda ha, tǝ ƙǝm mbusǝ sahadgha wa ƙǝl tal ahur ndan kee, ƙǝl yanɗi wurgha fadghǝn a sahadgha. Sahad nǝn ka a lǝghǝdgha laɓar Faara na chichirethlee hai. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Nanǝnya niya ɗǝrha thlǝmad wa ɗǝ. Amma thlǝk ni ǝngginiya nggi ɓalɗǝ ahu ƙǝshiirha tǝna nda wal wutsǝfayirha lǝlǝgɗa ahur ndan ƙǝla nani tǝghǝn ha. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Fǝrangɗi laɓar wa kanda ƙǝshiirha ƙǝm karɗǝ kanda fa, ƙǝsǝr mbǝ yi ƙǝshiirha ni kanda wa, ƙǝla nani mbǝ yi ƙǝshiirha ni nggi wa. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Mbi a hwan sa a tǝrangga kanda ma ƙǝshiirha wa, amma ndǝghang kanda hai tǝ tǝmbǝlfedɗi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Kanda mbǝ yi ƙǝshidɗa ni ya wa, ƙǝla nani mbǝ yi ƙǝshidɗa ni ya wa. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Tsawang kanda chahal tǝ ƙǝkafekkid wa, ƙǝsǝr laɓar wa ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ƙǝla thlǝnna nggi hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa, thlǝnɗi kanda ƙǝm ahu ƙǝshiirha ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Ƙǝsǝr fǝr ɗi fanna ƙǝla ǝn sataka ƙǝsǝr ka kanda, tǝna nda naarha chahal hu ƙǝkafekkid wa. <verse eid="JHN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Mbiyi a hwanda ka kanda kee wa, amma a fingya heu fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ nggi hu laɓar ndan. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Pǝpa niya hwanda a tendan heu a tsawa nda tal, ƙǝla nana ahur na nggi ƙǝm ahur wa. Ngwa tsawa nda tal ahur nǝm tǝna ƙǝshiirha fǝrƙǝkafek sa ni thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Fǝrangɗi mamnggidɗi kanda fǝree nana, tǝna nda tsaurha tal ƙǝla nanǝm tal. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Niya naarha ahur ndan, sa ƙǝm ahur na, tǝna nda tsaurha tal kula ǝn ˈyaara fa, tǝna ƙǝshiirha sǝndasǝ sa ni thlǝngga nggi ɓa tǝ ƙǝm nggǝmna kanda ƙǝla nggǝmna nggi. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Pǝpa, na minnasǝ nafini fǝree na ya, a na nda a thlǝmanna a mbǝɗi nanisǝ, tǝna nda naa mamnggidɗi fǝree nana, ƙǝsǝr nggǝmna nggi kapa na nda ǝna ƙǝshiirha. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Pǝpa na tǝ nggayirha, ko nanǝn sǝngwa ƙǝshiirha sa wa, amma sǝnɗi sa; nafini ya ƙǝm sǝndasǝ sa ni thlǝngga nggi ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Kyaɗang ɗi sa kanda ƙǝla nana, niya naarha pǝranggǝn kanda. Tǝna nggǝmndǝɗi nggǝmna nggi naarha tǝ kanda tǝ ƙǝm nee ahur ndan.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Ƙǝsang nda Yeeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matta26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Markus14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />A kwasamadɗi ngwalang na Yeeso hwan Faarɗi, mal Urshalima nǝn tǝɗanggǝn suhwad Kidron teena heu tǝ fatsahayighǝn. A pǝm suhwadɗi na hed ɗǝfya dzaitun sǝ, kyagha sahai tǝ fatsahayighǝn. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yahuda fǝrgha ndǝn ƙǝm sǝnɗǝ mbǝɗi, ƙǝsǝr na Yeeso yakh naarha wumnda hai tǝ fatsahayighǝn a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Nanǝn kee, ɗǝgha Yahuda ahu hedɗa ɗǝ tǝ sodjaya a samadghǝn, tǝ fa ƙǝla Ƙǝn Faara, thlǝnang na mamngya Firis ɓa tǝ Farisaya. Ƙǝs nda patilla ha, tǝ tochi, tǝ kari yanda. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />ˈWad Yeeso teena sǝnɗǝ ǝnɗi ɗǝgha katǝrarha hai tǝghǝn, kyagha pǝpal ɓa tsahang mee nǝn kanda, “Wun nun a kaɗaarha?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nggǝrang ngganda sǝ, “Yeeso Tǝ Nadzarat.” Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Nggini ndǝghǝn.” Yahuda tǝthlǝrɓu ɗi ƙǝt a pathlang ndan. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />A sayidɗi ndana Yeeso, “Nggini ndǝghǝn,” wuɗa nda samarǝn, samarǝn fǝla nda hweeɗe hai. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Nggǝrghǝn tsahang mee kanda, “Wun nun a kaɗaarha?” Ndang ngganda, “Yeeso Tǝnadzarat.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Ndanggi kun nggini ndǝghǝn. Ana nggi nun a kaɗaarha, malaman nafiniya wii nda.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Katǝra nǝn hai kee ka a lǝɗanggǝn laɓar ɗi ndanǝn, “A hur nafini fǝree na mbusǝ ƙǝɗeng ni wa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Tǝrgha Siman Mbiturus ƙǝɗanggǝn thlaukh ƙǝlarghǝn sǝ kyathlanggǝn thlǝmad mafad Firis ɗǝ na manggǝn a yi sǝma. (Thlǝm mafadɗiya Malkus). <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Amma ndangga Yeeso Mbiturus, “Wuɗang thlaukh ƙǝlar ɗi hu ƙǝnggǝn hai. Mbuwani mbang saarha tǝ wuhuleu sǝsaarha fǝree na Pǝpa wa?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗǝnda tǝ Yeeso a mbed Mamnda firis ɗǝ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matta26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Markus14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luka22:54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Tǝrgha Sodja yini, tǝ mamndǝ ndan tǝ fa ƙǝla Ƙǝn Faara ƙǝsang ngganda Yeeso ƙǝnang ngganda. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />ˈWa ɗǝrha nda tǝghǝn thlǝmad Hanana ɗǝ, ƙǝsǝr thlaɓǝr Kayafa ni na manda firis a sayidɗi. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa ndǝn ndangga fingya mamngya Yahudaya, mǝmǝl ni a mǝrgha niifa tal ka fingya fiya.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Katǝra ngaalla Mbiturus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matta26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Markus14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Tǝrgha Siman Mbiturus mbu samad Yeeso nǝn, niifa tal ahur fatsahayighǝn ƙǝm mbu samad Yeeso nǝn. Tǝtsahad ɗi ƙi Yeeso ya sǝn firis ndǝn na manggǝn, ndǝghǝnggi ƙǝm kyagha hu chelleeru firis ɗǝ na manggǝn tǝ Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Amma Mbiturus ishgha hai a kwakirma. Tahad tǝtsahad ɗi sǝnna firis ndǝn na manggǝn, wudgha, kalanggǝn nuɗa sǝ na a ƙǝla kwakirma ha, a kyagha hai tǝ Mbiturus. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Nuɗi na a mii kwakirma ndanggǝn Mbiturus, “Sa mbǝna tal ahur fatsahayighǝn wa?” Ndangga Mbiturus, “Awo, mbǝ nggini wa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Ƙǝsǝr na mbiirha sǝ, mafaya hur minda tǝ faƙǝlaya ha kanda a tǝk waarha fa. Mbiturus ƙǝm a thlǝman ndan a tǝk waarha fa.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamnda firistaya tsahang ɗǝ mee Yeeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matta26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Markus14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Tǝrgha firis na manggǝn tsahang mee nǝn Yeeso aten fatsahayighǝn tǝ tsahadghǝn ha. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Thlǝkki laɓaara a ƙǝshiirha a pǝpal. Ni naarha tsaharha ha hu ƙǝn tsahad Yahudaya, tǝ Ƙǝn Faara nǝm yakh wumnda sahai. Mbǝ ˈyasǝ thlǝk ni ɓǝɓee wa. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Kama nda na a tsahe mee ha? Tsahang mee fingya sǝkka fanna. Sǝnda ˈya ndani.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ndana Yeeso kee, tal ahur mamnggini na tsau tǝghǝn fa mbi Yeeso nen, ndanggǝn, “Na nggǝrang nda firis sǝ na manggǝn kiya wa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Ana ˈyasǝ thlǝk ni na ɗimi puruwun. Amma ana ƙǝkafek thlǝk ni, kama mbina nggi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Tǝrgha Hanana thlǝnanggǝn Yeeso a thlǝmad Kayafa ɗǝ na mamnda firis ƙǝƙǝna.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngaalla Mbiturus yi sǝri tǝ yi mahan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matta26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Markus14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Nana Mbiturus ƙǝt a tǝk waarha fa, tsahang mee nda, “Sa mbǝna tal ahur fatsahayighǝn wa?” Ngalgha Mbiturus ndǝghǝn, “Awo mbiyi ahur ndan wa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Tal ahur mafaya manda firis na hurfidghǝn ni niifɗi kyathlang na Mbiturus thlǝmadghǝn ɗǝ, tsahang mee nǝn Mbiturus, “Mbǝ naɗi kun tǝghǝn ahu hed dzaitun wa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Nggǝrgha Mbiturus ngaalghǝn. Tsu kee tǝtaagha ɗiyarha.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeeso a mbed Mbilatus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matta27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Markus15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />A tsar kyang na nda Yeeso sǝ a minda ki Kayafa ɗǝnda tǝghǝn minda ki Mbilatus ɗǝ ngwamnad Romaya. Kyawa nda tǝghǝn a minda ki ngwamna ɗa hai wa. Na mindan sǝ a tangsang ngganda fad ndan chahal tǝna nda hǝb ǝnnadmid tǝɗaarha. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Nanǝn kee kyagha Mbilatus thlǝmad ndan ɓa tsakh mee nǝn, “Ma ǝnana kamshi ɗiya huhwa nun ndǝn?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Nggǝrang ngganda sǝ, “A ǝna wa kamshiɗi ˈya mbuwa ngga ya wa, kam ɓowan ndǝn ɓa wa!” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Ndangga Mbilatus kanda, “Ɗaama ɗǝ tǝghǝn ɗun ngwang kumarha tafad nun tǝ yinun ngyakhrha.” Nggǝrangga Yahudaya sǝ, “Ai, fǝrang ngwanda sǝsǝmnda kan na a ɓǝlanggan niifa wa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Katǝrana ǝnɗa hai ya ka a lǝɗang ngganda laɓarɗi ki Yeeso sakh nǝn tǝ kwaman mǝrrǝghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Tǝrgha Mbilatus nggǝrgha hur minda hai, aah Yeeso nǝn ɗǝ tsahang mee nǝn, “Sani kutǝr Yahudaya wa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Tsakh mii huten wa niya wa, nduwa na fingya sǝ purowa laɓara aten na wa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Nggǝrangga Mbilatus sǝ, “Mbǝ tǝ Yahudarha ni nggi wa, nafiwa ni, tǝ mamngya firistaya ɓagha tǝ sa thlǝmad na ɓa. Mani ǝnana?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Kutǝr yidna mbǝ yi ƙǝshiid ɗa ni ya wa. Andam kutǝryid na yi ƙǝshidɗa ni ya, kam na fatsahayina a yanda amawana Yahudaya ƙǝseerha. Amma kutǝr yidna mbǝ yi ƙǝshidɗa ni ya wa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Ndangga Mbilatus, “Ashe kutǝra ni sa wa!” Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Sa ndagha, kutǝra ni nggi. Nggǝt na nda nggi hu ƙǝshidɗiya ka tarɗi ya, a thlǝk ƙǝkafek ni. Kala niifa na midghǝn ƙǝkafek, nǝn kee thlǝmaarha fa.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Tsahangga Mbilatus mee, “Mani ƙǝkafek?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Ngwang nda kumad mǝrra Yeeso</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matta27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Markus15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Tǝrgha kyagha Mbilatus ƙǝsha ɗǝ ndanggǝn Yahudayini wumngga hai, “Mbǝ ˈya sǝ ɗimi wal ni a fad kamshiɗiya wa. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Amma na ǝntin nun sǝ kala far wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha, ni kalang niifa kun hai tal ƙǝnang nanda ahu porsǝna. Na mid nun sǝ a kalang kutǝr Yahudaya ni kun hai wa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Amma tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ, “Mbǝ niifɗiya wa, Mbarabas na mid nan!” Mbarabas ƙǝm tǝ fasa farha ni.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Tǝrgha Mbilatus fǝr Yeeso nǝn a sodjaya tsaɗaghǝn nda. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Taksaagha sodjaya ǝnfatta teena tǝ ndaaha pang nggǝnda teena. Tǝrgha ɓa nda ɓa tǝ kaɓaarha tur yi kutǝryirha kalang nggǝnda fa. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Ɓa nda thlǝmadghǝn ɓa na nda a ndangˈya yi waa farha, “Alvari, kutǝr Yahudaya!” Mbiighǝn nda. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Nggǝrgha Mbilatus kyaarha ɓa ndanggǝn Yahudayini, “Nanǝnya niya kyang Yeeso kun ɓa, na minna sǝ a sǝnunsǝ ƙǝsang nggi tǝ ɗimiyirha fa wa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Kyagha Yeeso sǝ tenggǝn fǝfaɗa tǝ ndaaha, tǝ tur kaɓad kutǝryirha a fadghǝn, ndangga Mbilatus kanda, “Kǝlama niifɗiya.” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Nana mamngya firistaya ndǝn tǝ fa ƙǝla Ƙǝn Faara tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ, “Tawaman ɗǝ! Tawaman ɗǝ!” Ndangga Mbilatus kanda, “Ɗamaɗǝ ɗun tawang ɗǝ tafan nun, nggi kam nawi ndǝn tǝ ˈya na ɗimi fa wa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Tǝrgha Yahudayini nggǝrang ngganda sǝ, “Na ngyahad nǝm sǝ, ˈya ndaana ngyahadɗi kamɗǝ a mǝrgha, ƙǝsǝr aaghǝn fadghǝn Wan Faara.” <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Sǝkna Mbilatus kee nggǝrghǝn chik tǝrǝmnda. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Nggǝrghǝn kyaarha tǝ Yeeso ahu chelleru ɗǝ tsahang mee nǝn ha, “Ɓagha ɓa a yanggi?” Amma nggǝrangwa Yeeso sǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Ndangga Mbilatus, “Karna fa a kaleegha sǝ? Sǝngwa sǝ niyi tǝ sǝsǝmnda ha na a kal sani hai nduwa tawo wanda ɗǝ wa?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “A mbǝ Faara fǝrowa sǝsǝmnda wa mbǝ ˈya sǝ na mbang ǝneerha wa. Yanɗi fǝrgha nggi ahu harwa hai kal ɗǝ sa ɗimiyirha.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Hǝrǝm na Mbilatus sǝk laɓarɗi ya na midghǝn sǝ a kal Yeeso nǝn hai, amma Yahudayini na nda a tǝrang urad ndan sǝ, “A kal na niifɗa hai ya, mbǝ pashid Kaisar ni sa wa. Kala niifa ndaagha kutǝra ni tǝsar Kaisar ni.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Sǝkna Mbilatus laɓaryini kee, kyagha ɓa tǝ Yeeso. Tǝrgha Mbilatus tsauka aten tsǝnggam ngwa kumarha sǝ, a mbǝrha na nda aarha “feera na ngga”, Ibraniyaya na nda aaghǝn “Nggabbata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />A far ɗemnda wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha ni yanfaara a sǝrǝkrha. Ndangga Mbilatus Yahudayini, “Ƙǝlama kutǝr nun ya!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Amma Yahuda yini tǝrang ngganda urad ndan sǝ, “Ɓǝlaman, ɓǝlaman, tawaman ɗǝ!” Tsahangga mbilatus mee kanda, “Na mid nun sǝ tawang nggi kutǝr nun ɗǝ wa?” Nggǝrangga mamnda firistaya sǝ, “Mbǝ kutǝr nan sǝ pak wa ƙǝl Kaisar.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Tǝrgha Mbilatus fǝrang Yeeso nǝn kanda ka a tawang ngganda ɗǝ. Nanǝn kee wii nda tǝ Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Tǝranggǝn kaɗidghǝn tafadghǝn a mbǝrha ɗǝ na nda aarha mbǝd ɓalhwad teena. Ibraniyaya na nda aaghǝn, “Nggolggota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />A mbǝɗa ni tawang na nda Yeeso saaɗǝ tǝ nafiya sǝri, tal a yisǝmadghǝn, tal ƙǝm a yikawadghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Chirelthgha Mbilatus tǝ ndaarha, “YEESO TƏNADZARAT, KUTƏR YAHUDAYA.” Tawang ngganda chireethɗi a man ten kaɗidɗi. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Yahudaya hangga karatangga chireelth ɗi ƙǝsǝr mbǝɗi tawang na nda Yeeso saaɗǝ nǝghǝn tsau tǝ Urshalima fa. Chireelth ɗiya ǝnagha ndan tǝ mii Yahudaya, tǝ mii Romaya, tǝ ƙǝm mii Helenaya. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Tǝrgha mamngya firistaya ndang ngganda Mbilatus, “A chireethleng na hai ‘Kutǝr Yahudaya wa,’ amma chireethleng hai, ‘Niifɗiya ndanggǝn fadghǝn kutǝr Yahudaya ni.’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Nggǝrangga Mbilatus kanda sǝ, “ˈYa chireethleng ni hai, chirethleng ɗi hai.” <verse eid="JHN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Akwasamadɗi tawang na sodja yini Yeeso ɗǝ, harang ngganda karidghǝn ndǝghang ngganda hai mbǝdghǝn faɗa kowunni tǝ yighǝn. Ənagha nda kee ƙǝm tǝ kaɓadghǝn tsǝna nda a uradghǝn hai ta sarghǝn ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Ndangga sodja yini ndan, “A njarang ɗǝm kaɓad ɗaɗǝ ya wa, amma tama ǝna chacha nǝm a tenggǝn tǝ wunni a hǝɓang.” Katǝrana ǝnɗa hai ya ka a lǝɗang ngganda ˈya ndaana Ɗeleewar Faara, “Ndǝghang ngganda karidna hai a pathlang ndan, ǝna chacha nda aten kaɓad na.” Ənɗa ni ǝnana sodjaya. <verse eid="JHN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Nafiya ishgha tsau tǝ kaɗidɗa fa nda man Yeeso, tǝ wanman, Mairamu nu Kilobas, tǝ Mairamu magdaliya. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Nana Yeeso man tǝ tǝtsahadɗi keeghǝn nggǝm nǝn ƙǝt tsau tǝghǝn fa, ndanggǝn man, “Kulo wanwa ya.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Tǝrgha ndanggǝn tetsahadɗi, “Kulo muwa ya.” Ka farɗi ɗǝgha tǝtsahadɗi tǝ man Yeeso wuri keeghǝn ɗǝ.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Merra Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Sǝn Yeeso sǝ nanǝnya ngwalang ɗǝ targhǝn. Ka a lǝghǝdgha ˈya ndaana Ɗeleewar Faara, ndǝghǝn, “Na hushimnda fanna.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Na ƙǝthlikrha sǝ a mbǝɗi lǝlǝgɗa tǝ aam inabi chichakh. Nanǝn kee tǝtǝnang ngganda soso tǝ aam inabi na chichakh, pang ngganda hu sǝsaala nzang pang nggǝnda Yeeso mii sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Taarang na Yeeso ndǝghǝn, “Ngwala ɗǝ!” Tǝrgha kwanggǝn tenggǝn hai kal yiɓǝdghǝnǝn hai.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulth nda Yeeso tǝ peela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Nanǝnya ɗemnda far wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha ni, a ɗalth mbǝrha hai ndǝna far yiɓǝdɗi, Ƙǝsǝr mamnda Yahudayini mbǝ mindan sǝ nagha mǝrya nafini aten kaɗiirha a far yiɓǝdɗi wa, ƙǝsǝr far yiɓǝdɗi fara ni na manggǝn. Tǝrgha Yahudayini hwan Mbilatus nda a hwasang ngganda ndǝlengya nafini, tǝ ƙǝm tǝrang ngganda mǝryina hai. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ɗǝgha sodjaya ɗǝ ɗa nda hwasang ndǝlengya nafini sǝri tawang na nda kanda ɗǝ tǝ Yeeso. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Amma ɓa na nda thlǝmad Yeeso ɓa ƙǝla nda hai ˈwaɗǝ teena mǝrɗǝ hwasang ngwa nda ndǝlenggighǝn wa. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Tal ahur sodja yini kulth Yeeso nǝn tǝ peela a ƙǝlarghǝn tsu kee kyagha aama ɓa tǝ faara. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Niifɗi nagha ǝn ɗi katǝra hai ndǝn pǝrgha ndǝn. Ənɗi pǝr nǝn ƙǝkafek ni, pǝr nǝn ndǝn kee tǝnun fǝrƙǝkafek. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Katǝra na ǝnɗa hai kee ya ka a lǝghǝdgha laɓar Faara ndaa nǝn, “Mbǝ alghǝn sǝ tal hwasagha wa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Na laɓar Faara sǝ ƙǝm ndaagha, “Na nda a ƙǝlang yanɗi kuthlang na nda.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pang nda mǝrra Yeeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matta27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Markus15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Akwasamad ǝngginiya, Yisufu niif Aramatiya tǝtsahad Yeeso ni ɓǝɓee ƙǝsǝr nǝghǝn a tǝrǝm Yahudaya, ɓagha thlǝmad Mbilatus ɓa na a fǝrang kwamana nǝn a ɗǝgha tǝrang mǝrra Yeeso hai. Fǝrang na Mbilatus kwamana, ɗǝgha ɗǝ tǝranggǝn merra Yeeso hai aten kaɗidɗi. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Niifɗi na nda aarha Nikodimus ˈwagha ɗǝrha thlǝmad Yeeso ɗǝ a fǝɗikrha, takkwa ɗǝ Yisufu ƙǝsɗǝ urdi ha na nda aarha mur tǝ alos sǝlna hadghǝn kilo kumnggit mahan (30). <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Tǝrgha nafini kyab ya faɗang ngganda mǝrra Yeeso hu kaɓaarha na pǝpet irang urdi nda fa ƙǝla na Yahudaya ǝnaarha. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />A mbǝɗi tawang na nda Yeeso sǝ na heerha sǝ, ahu hedɗi na kwad mǝrra sǝ rana nda, ˈwawa na nda pa mǝrra sǝ. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Tsaunǝn far ɗemnda far yiɓǝd Yahudaya ni, nanǝn na kwarha sǝ tsau a mbǝɗi, Pang ngganda Yeeso a mbǝɗi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Thlid Yeeso sǝ ahu mǝrra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matta28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Markus16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />A tsar ƙǝrǝt a far ladi, mbǝrha liwid-liwid, Mairamu Magdaliya ɗǝgha ten kwad Yeeso ɗǝ, ƙǝlagha hai kwatǝrang nda fer ɗaɗǝ na a mii kwadɗi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Tǝrgha thliigha tǝ ɗaarha thlǝmad Siman Mbiturus ɗǝ tǝ tǝtsahadɗi nggǝmna Yeeso ndanggǝn kanda, “Tǝrang nda Chinǝm sǝ ahu kwaarha, sǝnggum mbǝɗi ɗǝfang na nda saɗǝ wa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Tǝrgha nda Mbiturus tǝ tahad tǝtsahadɗi katǝrangganda ɗǝrha a ten kwadɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Kanda kyab ƙǝs ɗaarha nda, amma yanɗi tǝtsaharha kalɗǝ Mbiturus ɗaarha ˈwagha a ten kwadɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Ɓǝrgha hai ƙǝlagha hu kwadɗa ɗǝ na kaɓad pa mǝrɗa nǝn, amma kya wa hur kwadɗa ɗǝ wa. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Tǝrgha Mbiturus ɓagha a ɓa a kwasamarha, kyagha hur kwadɗa hai. Na kaɓad pa mǝrɗa nǝn a mbǝɗi. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Tǝ ƙǝm na kaɓadɗa nǝn faɗang na nda ten Yeeso sǝ ta a man patu. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Tǝrgha yanɗi tǝtsaharha ˈwagha ten kwadɗa ɗǝ ma Mbiturus kyagha hur kwadɗa hai ƙǝm, nanǝn ǝnggini heu ya fǝrƙǝkafek nǝn. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Pa ka weriya sǝnang ngwanda ˈya hai ndana Ɗeleewar Faara, na Yeeso a thliirha sǝ hu mǝra wa. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Tǝrgha fatsahayini wuɗa nda wure ɗǝ.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyad Yeeso fadghǝn a Mairamu magdaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Amma Mairamu Magdaliya ishgha a ten kwadɗi nagha a tǝrha. Ndǝghǝn aten tǝrha ɓǝrgha hai ƙǝlagha hur kwadɗa ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Na fa thlǝngya Faara nǝn sǝri tǝ lukkya fa pǝpet-pǝpet kanda tsǝtsau a mbǝɗi pang nanda Yeeso sǝ, tal a man tenggǝn tal a man sarghǝn. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Tǝrgha tsahangga fa thlǝngya Faara mee nuɗi, “Sa nuɗiya mani na a tǝrha?” Ndanggǝn kanda, “Tǝrang nda yina Chinǝm sǝ, sǝngwi mbǝɗi ɗǝfang na nda saaɗǝ wa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ndǝghǝn a nggǝlang miighǝn kee, kyahar nǝn hai ƙǝlagha hai Yeeso ƙǝt. Amma sǝnangwa hai Yeeso ni wa. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Tǝrgha tsahangga Yeeso mee, “Sa nuɗiya, mani na a tǝrha? Wun na a kaɗaarha?” Tamnggǝn ndaarha tǝtaara ni na ahur hedɗi. Ndanggǝn, “Ana sa ni tǝrangga, pǝre mbǝɗi ɗǝfang na saaɗǝ ɗi tǝrang ɓa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Tǝrgha ndangga Yeeso, “Mairamu!” Kyahargha Mairamu man thlǝmad Yeeso ɗǝ ndǝghǝn tǝ mii Aramaya, “Rabboni!” Ndaarha ni “Mala”. <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Ndangga Yeeso, “A tsuwar na nggi fa wa, ƙǝsǝr ɗǝwi thlǝmad Pǝpa ɗǝ ˈwan wa. Amma ɗuwa thlǝmad wan manggina ɗǝ ndangga kanda, niya ɗǝrha thlǝmad Chinɗa ɗǝ tǝ yinun China, Faar na tǝ ƙǝm yinun Faara.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Tǝrgha Mairamu ɗǝgha thlǝmad fatsahayina ɗǝ ndanggǝn kanda, “Naɗi Chinǝm!” Pǝrang laɓar ɗa nǝn kanda ndang na Yeeso.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyad Yeeso fadghǝn a fa tsahayighǝn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matta28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Markus16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Tsu a farɗi a figrha a far ladi, fatsahaya Yeeso wumnda hai a mbǝrha tal, chang ngganda kwaminda a tendan ɗǝ, ƙǝsǝr na nda a tǝrǝm Yahudaya. Kula sǝndǝndan sǝ ƙǝla nda hai Yeeso ƙǝt a maɗufun ndan ndǝghǝn, “A tsauka ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝ kun.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Akwasamadghǝn thlǝk nǝn laɓarɗi ya kyaɗang haaryighǝn nǝn kanda tǝ ƙǝlarghǝn. Tǝrgha fatsahayini lǝgɗa nda tǝ wutsǝfayirha, ƙǝsǝr nanda Chinǝm. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Nggǝrgha Yeeso ndang nda kanda, “A tsauka ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝ kun. Ƙǝla thlǝnna Pǝpa nggi ɓa, niya thlǝn kun kee ƙǝm.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Tǝrgha peng ɓereurha nǝn kanda fa ndǝghǝn, “Thlaama Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Kala niifa chahang nun ɗimiyidghǝn ɗǝ, chahang ndan ɗǝ, kala niifa ƙǝm chahang ngwa nun ɗimiyidghǝn ɗǝ, mba nda chahanggǝn ɗǝ wa.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nda Yeeso tǝ Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Ahu sayidɗiya, Toma tal ahur fatsahayini na thlǝm ɓashadghǝn Muɗaarha, mbǝ ahur ndan wa a sayidɗi ɓa na Yeeso ɓa. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Nanǝn kee, ndang ngganda, “Naɗan Chinǝm.” Amma ndangga Toma kanda, “Mbi fǝrƙǝkafek wa ƙǝl a naɗi kwat kusa ɗi a haarghǝn, pang nggi haar na saɗǝ tǝ ƙǝlarghǝn wa mbi tam fǝrƙǝkafek wa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Akwasamad ɓeena uvaɗa fa tsahayini kanda a mbǝrha tal, Toma ƙǝm nǝghǝn ahur ndan kwaminda chicha. Amma kula sǝndǝndan sǝ ƙǝla nda hai Yeeso ƙǝt a maɗufun ndan ndǝghǝn, “A tsauka ɗǝɗemnggirha tǝ kun.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Tǝrgha Yeeso ndanggǝn Toma, “Pang wan haar wa mbǝɗa hai ya, ƙǝlang harna. Tsǝwaru ƙǝlar na fa, tǝna malang ngaala, fǝrƙǝkafek na.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Ndangga Toma, “Yina Chinǝm, tǝ yina Faara!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Ndangga Yeeso, “Ka nana nggi ndǝn fǝr na ƙǝkafek? Fa parkaya ni nafiya nawa nggi, amma fǝr nda ƙǝkafek.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kama nda chireelth nanda ɗeleewar ɗiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Əna Yeeso ǝnwulteengya hangga a yid fatsahayighǝn chireethleng ngwana nda hai ahu ɗeleewar ɗiya. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Amma chireethleng na nda ǝnɗa hai ya tǝnun fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ ndaarha Yeeso ni Ƙǝrǝsti, Wan Faara. A hu fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun a ndǝghǝn, nun a wal yibrha ahu thlǝmnggǝn.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Kyad Yeeso fadghǝn a fatsahayighǝn mǝd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Tsǝɓaku kyadna Yeeso fadghǝn a fatsahayighǝn a mii wutambar Tibariya. Katǝraghǝn hai kiya. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Nda Siman Mbiturus, tǝ Toma na nda aarha Muɗarha, tǝ Nataniyel ɓagha ɓa a Kaana yi Nggalili, tǝ wangya Dzabadi, tǝ fingya fatsahaya sǝri, kanda heu a mbǝrha tal. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Tǝrgha ndagha Siman Mbiturus, “Ɗǝni ka tǝmnda ɗǝ.” Ndangga fingya fatsahaya, “Kan ma nan a ɗǝrha ɗǝ a samadwa.” Wii nda, tǝra nda hu kombuwol hai. Amma a fǝɗikɗi mbǝ ˈyasǝ ƙǝs na nda wa. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />A tsar ƙǝrǝt, ishgha Yeeso a mii ƙǝƙǝshɓangnda, amma fatsahayighǝn kukwalang ngwa nda hai tǝwunni wa. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Tǝrgha ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Wundǝlaya, tǝna sǝ a haar nun wa?” Nggǝrang ngganda sǝ, “Awo.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Muwa man panggam nun hai tǝ man yisǝmad kombuwol ɗi nun a waala.” Nanǝn kee muwang ngganda hai ƙǝla ndang na Yeeso kanda, ƙǝs tǝna nda mbang ngwa nda kahang nda ahur kombuwol ɗa ɓa wa ƙǝsǝr ka hang nda tǝna. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Tǝrgha tǝtsahadɗi nggǝmna Yeeso kaan ndanggǝn Mbiturus, “Chinǝm ni!” Hǝrǝmna Siman Mbiturus sǝkrha, “Chinǝm ni,” kalanggǝn luwudghǝn ƙǝsǝr kalang ɗa hai. Tǝrgha pǝrgha ahu aamɗa hai a mii ƙǝƙǝshɓangnda ɗǝ. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Fingya fatsahaya ɗǝnda man patu ɗǝ tsau tǝ ƙǝƙǝshɓangnda ahu kombuwol. Na nda a kahang panggam ɗa sǝ na lǝlǝgɗa tǝ tǝna. Ƙǝsǝr mba nda inggun tǝ chehweerha wa, ƙǝla thlǝtta saara haru kumnggitghǝn mahan. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Sǝl na nda ƙǝƙǝshɓangnda ɗǝ, na tsal waarha nda a mbǝɗi tǝ tǝna a tenggǝn tǝ ƙǝm mburodi. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Ɓama ɓa tǝ fingya tǝngya ƙǝs nun kukuling ya.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Tǝrgha Siman Mbiturus kyagha hu kombuwol hai kahanggǝn panggam ɗi a mii ƙǝƙǝshɓangnda ɗǝ. Nǝghǝn lǝlǝgɗa tǝ tǝngya na mǝmanggǝn haru tal tǝ kumnggit tuf kap mahan, heu tǝ hang nda tǝnggini thluwus wa panggam ɗi wa. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Ndangga Yeeso kanda, “Ɓama ɓa ɓun hǝb ǝnnarhami.” A hur fatsahayini mbusǝ ndengga yidghǝn tsahang mee nǝn, “Wunni sa wa?” Ƙǝsǝr sǝndasǝ Chinǝm ni. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Tǝrangga Yeeso mburodi sǝ fǝranggǝnǝn kanda, ǝnagha kee tǝ tǝnɗi ƙǝm. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Nanǝnya sar Yeeso yi mahan ni nǝn naarha kyad fadghǝn a fatsahayighǝn a kwasamadɗi thleng nanda sǝ ahu mǝrra. <verse eid="JHN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />A kwasamadɗi ngwalang nanda hǝb ǝnnarhami tsahangga Yeeso mee Mbiturus, “Siman wan Yahaya, nggǝmna nggi ma fingyayini ya wa?” Nggǝrangga Mbiturus sǝ, “Haˈi, Chinǝm, sǝnnasǝ tafadwa nggǝmɗi sa.” Ndangga Yeeso, “Fǝrang ǝnnarhami wan chaurayina.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Nggǝrgha Yeeso tsahang mee yi sǝri, “Siman wan Yahaya, nggǝmna nggi wa?” Nggǝrangga Mbiturus sǝ, “Haˈi, Chinǝm, sǝnnasǝ tafadwa nggǝmɗi sa.” Ndangga Yeeso, “Lafu chaurayina.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Nggǝrgha Yeeso tsahang mee yi mahan, “Siman wan Yahaya, nggǝmna nggi wa?” Sǝbgha hur Mbiturus ɗǝ ka tsahang na Yeeso mee yi mahan aten ndaarha, “Nggǝmna nggi wa?” Ndanggǝn, “Chinǝm sǝnna ǝngya heu, sǝnnasǝ ƙǝm nggǝmɗi sa.” Ndangga Yeeso, “Fǝrang ǝnnarhami chaurayina. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Niya puro ƙǝkafek, a sayidɗi nana wundǝlarha, na ngwarha fa ɗǝna a mbǝrha ɗǝ na midwa, amma a suhur na, na harang haar yiwa sǝ nggowa niifa fa ɗǝgha tǝ sa a mbǝrha ɗǝ mbuwa na midwa ɗǝrha saaɗǝ.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(Thlǝkna Yeeso ndǝn kee ka a kyad tur kwaman ɗa nǝn na Mbiturus a mǝra sǝ ka mananggǝn thlǝm Faara.) Tǝrgha ndanggǝn, “Mbuwu samanna.” <verse eid="JHN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Kyahargha Mbiturus hai na tǝtsahadɗa nǝn nggǝmna Yeeso kaan a mbu samad ndan. Yanɗa ni tǝngsangga Yeeso fa a sayidɗi na nanda a hǝb ǝnnarhami yi Wutsǝfayid Tǝɗaarha tsahang nǝn mee Yeeso, “Chinǝm wunni na a fǝr sa?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Nana Mbiturus ndǝn, tsahang mee nǝn Yeeso, “Chinǝm, niifɗiya wu?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Nggǝrangga Yeeso sǝ, “Ana minna sǝ malang nggi tǝ yibrha ta far wuttǝna ɓa, ma njiɗowa? Sa mbuwu samanna.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Tǝrgha laɓarɗi ya welgha ɗǝ a mii fa takkwaya Yeeso tǝ ndaarha tǝtsahadɗi ya mbǝ a mǝra wa. Amma ndawa Yeeso mbǝ a mǝra wa, ˈya ndanǝn, “Ana minna sǝ malang nggi tǝ yibrha ta far wuttǝna ɓa, ma njiɗowa?” <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Tǝtsahadɗa ni ya, nagha ǝnggini heu, chirethleng nǝn hai tǝ ƙǝm ˈya ndanǝn ƙǝkafek ni. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Na fingya ǝngya sǝ hangga ǝnana Yeeso. A ndam chirethleng nda kanda hai heu, kam mbǝ ƙǝshiirha mbang ƙǝs ɗeleewar yina ha chireelth nanda wa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>